  <data key="d0">{"name":"Individual Term Life Insurance","text":"===== Page 1 =====\nINDIVIDUAL TERM LIFE INSURANCE POLICY  \nPolicy Number: SLAC-2025-001  \nInsurer: Sentinel Life Assurance Company  \nPrincipal Office: 101 Guardian Way, Hartford, CT 06103  \nInsured: Jordan Everett Hughes  \nPolicy Owner: Jordan Everett Hughes  \nEffective Date: August 7, 2025  \nPolicy Type: Level Term Life Insurance – 20 Years  \nGoverning Law: The contract shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the \nlaws of the State of Colorado.  \nThis policy is a legal contract between the Policy Owner and Sentinel Life Assurance \nCompany. In consideration of the application and payment of premiums as provided, the \nCompany promises to pay the Death Benefit to the named Beneficiary, subject to the terms, \nconditions, exclusions, and limitations set forth herein.  \nThis policy, together with the application and any attached riders or endorsements, constitutes \nthe entire contract. No change shall be valid unless made in writing and signed by an officer of \nthe Company.  \nThis policy contains a two-year contestability period and a suicide exclusion clause. Please \nreview all pages carefully.  \nSigned for Sentinel Life Assurance Company as of the Effective Date.  \n__________________________\n\n===== Page 2 =====\nEleanor B. Raynor  - Chief Executive Officer \nSCHEDULE OF BENEFITS  \nInsured Name: Jordan Everett Hughes  \nPolicy Number: SLAC-2025-001  \nPolicy Type: Level Term Life Insurance – 20 Years  \nIssue Age: 37  \nGender: Male  \nRisk Classification: Standard Non-Smoker  \nFace Amount: $500,000  \nInitial Premium: $42.00 Monthly  \nPremium Mode: Monthly Bank Draft  \nPremium Guaranteed Period: 20 Years  \nCoverage Term: August 7, 2025 – August 7, 2045  \nBeneficiary: Elaine M. Hughes (Wife), Primary  \nContingent Beneficiary: Morgan L. Hughes (Daughter)  \nRiders Attached: Accelerated Death Benefit Rider  \nReinstatement Period: 5 Years from Lapse  \nPremiums are level and guaranteed not to increase during the guaranteed term period. \nCoverage will terminate at the end of the term unless renewed or converted as specified in \nthe contract. All benefits are","summary":"This is a 20-year level term life insurance policy issued to Jordan Everett Hughes by Sentinel Life Assurance Company, with a face amount of $500,000 and monthly premiums of $42.00 guaranteed for the duration of the term. The primary beneficiary is his wife, Elaine M. Hughes, with their daughter Morgan L. Hughes as contingent beneficiary. The policy includes an accelerated death benefit rider and features a two-year contestability period and suicide exclusion. Coverage expires on August 7, 2045, unless renewed or converted.","topics":["Life Insurance","Term Coverage","Death Benefit","Policy Terms"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Identification","sentence":"The policy number is SLAC-2025-001.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Number","Insurance Contract","Document Reference"],"entities":[{"name":"Jordan Everett Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"insured person under policy","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"Elaine M. Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Morgan L. Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Eleanor B. Raynor","type":"PERSON","role":"Chief Executive Officer signing authority","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sentinel Life Assurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer and contracting party","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"Hartford, CT 06103","type":"LOCATION","role":"principal office location of insurer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Individual Term Life Insurance Policy","type":"POLICY","role":"contractual agreement governing coverage","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001","Level Term Life Insurance – 20 Years"]},{"name":"August 7, 2025","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":["August 7, 2045"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["$500,000"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of life insurance coverage","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"$42.00","type":"AMOUNT","role":"initial monthly premium amount","relational_anchors":["Monthly Bank Draft"]},{"name":"20 Years","type":"TERM","role":"duration of guaranteed premium and coverage","relational_anchors":["Level Term Life Insurance – 20 Years"]},{"name":"two-year contestability period","type":"CLAUSE","role":"limitation on claim validity early in policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"suicide exclusion clause","type":"CLAUSE","role":"restriction on benefit payments due to suicide","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"RIDER","role":"additional provision allowing partial benefit access","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]}]},{"name":"Insurer Identification","sentence":"The insurer is Sentinel Life Assurance Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Insurer","Sentinel Life Assurance Company","Policy Issuer"],"entities":[{"name":"Jordan Everett Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"insured person under policy","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"Elaine M. Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Morgan L. Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Eleanor B. Raynor","type":"PERSON","role":"Chief Executive Officer signing authority","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sentinel Life Assurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer and contracting party","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"Hartford, CT 06103","type":"LOCATION","role":"principal office location of insurer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Individual Term Life Insurance Policy","type":"POLICY","role":"contractual agreement governing coverage","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001","Level Term Life Insurance – 20 Years"]},{"name":"August 7, 2025","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":["August 7, 2045"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"monetary payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["$500,000"]},{"name":"$500,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of life insurance coverage","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"$42.00","type":"AMOUNT","role":"initial monthly premium amount","relational_anchors":["Monthly Bank Draft"]},{"name":"20 Years","type":"TERM","role":"duration of guaranteed premium and coverage","relational_anchors":["Level Term Life Insurance – 20 Years"]},{"name":"two-year contestability period","type":"CLAUSE","role":"limitation on claim validity early in policy","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"suicide exclusion clause","type":"CLAUSE","role":"restriction on benefit payments due to suicide","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"RIDER","role":"additional provision allowing partial benefit access","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]}]},{"name":"Principal Office Location","sentence":"The principal office of Sentinel Life Assurance Company is located at 101 Guardian Way, Hartford, CT 06103.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Sentinel Life Assurance Company","principal office address","policy contact information"],"entities":[{"name":"Jordan Everett Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"insured person under policy","relational_anchors":["SLAC-2025-001"]},{"name":"Elaine M. Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Morgan L. Hughes","type":"PERSON","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Eleanor B. Raynor","type":"PERSON","role":"Chief Executive Officer signing authority","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Sentinel Life Assurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer and contracting party","re