</node>
<node id="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Life Insurance Policy Provisions","text":". If no Owner is named, the \nInsured shall be deemed the Owner.  \nRight to Examine Policy  \nThe Owner has the right to examine this policy for a period of 20 days from receipt. If not \nsatisfied, the policy may be returned to the Company for a full refund of any premium paid. \nUpon return, the policy shall be void from inception and treated as if never issued.  \nContract Modification  \nNo change or waiver of any provision in this policy shall be valid unless made in writing and \nsigned by an authorized officer of the Company. No agent or broker is authorized to modify\n\n===== Page 5 =====\nthe policy or waive any of its provisions. \n \n \n \nPOLICY PROVISIONS – PART II  \nIncontestability  \nExcept for nonpayment of premium, this policy shall be incontestable after it has been in \nforce during the lifetime of the Insured for two years from the Effective Date. Any \nmisrepresentations or omissions that materially affect the acceptance of risk may render the \npolicy void if discovered within this period.  \nSuicide Exclusion  \nIf the Insured dies by suicide, while sane or insane, within two years from the Effective \nDate, the Company’s liability shall be limited to a refund of premiums paid, without \ninterest, less any indebtedness.  \nMisstatement of Age or Gender  \nIf the age or gender of the Insured has been misstated, the amount of insurance shall be \nadjusted to the amount that the premium paid would have purchased at the correct age or \ngender.  \nGrace Period  \nA grace period of 31 days will be granted for the payment of each premium after the first. \nDuring the grace period, the policy remains in force. If the Insured dies during the grace \nperiod, any unpaid premium due will be deducted from the Death Benefit.  \nLapse and Termination  \nIf a premium is not paid before the end of the grace period, this policy shall lapse as of the \ndue date of the unpaid premium, and coverage shall terminate with no further benefits \npayable, except as provided under the Reinstatement provision.\n\n===== Page 6 =====\nReinstatement  \nA lapsed policy may be reinstated within five (5) years of lapse by providing evidence of \ninsurability satisfactory to the Company and payment of all past due premiums with interest, \nas determined by the Company at the time of reinstatement. \n \n \n","summary":"This document details essential provisions of a life insurance policy, including the default designation of the insured as owner if none is specified. The owner has a 20-day right to examine the policy and receive a full refund if unsatisfied. All policy changes require written authorization from an official company representative. Key protections include incontestability after two years (except for non-payment), a suicide clause limiting payout to refunded premiums within two years, adjustment of coverage based on accurate age or gender, a 31-day grace period for premium payments, and the possibility of reinstating a lapsed policy within five years upon meeting health and payment criteria.","topics":["Insurance Policy Terms","Policy Ownership","Contestability &amp; Suicide Clause","Reinstatement Conditions"],"facts":[{"name":"Default Ownership Rule","sentence":"If no Owner is named, the Insured shall be deemed the Owner.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["default ownership","insured as owner","ownership designation"],"entities":[{"name":"Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to review policy","relational_anchors":["right to examine policy"]},{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":["lifetime of the Insured","death benefit","nonpayment of premium"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer with authority over terms","relational_anchors":["authorized officer of the Company","refund of premiums paid","determine reinstatement interest"]},{"name":"Effective Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"starting point for contestability and suicide exclusion","relational_anchors":["two years from the Effective Date","suicide exclusion applies within two years"]},{"name":"20 days","type":"DATE","role":"duration for examining policy","relational_anchors":["from receipt","if not satisfied, return for refund"]},{"name":"three years","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for reinstating lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within five (5) years of lapse"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period for premium payment","relational_anchors":["after the first premium","during which policy remains in force"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount required for continued coverage","relational_anchors":["any premium paid","past due premiums with interest","unpaid premium due"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["deducted from the Death Benefit"]}]},{"name":"Owner's Examination Right","sentence":"The Owner has the right to examine this policy for a period of 20 days from receipt.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Policy Review","Ownership Rights","20-Day Inspection"],"entities":[{"name":"Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to review policy","relational_anchors":["right to examine policy"]},{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":["lifetime of the Insured","death benefit","nonpayment of premium"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer with authority over terms","relational_anchors":["authorized officer of the Company","refund of premiums paid","determine reinstatement interest"]},{"name":"Effective Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"starting point for contestability and suicide exclusion","relational_anchors":["two years from the Effective Date","suicide exclusion applies within two years"]},{"name":"20 days","type":"DATE","role":"duration for examining policy","relational_anchors":["from receipt","if not satisfied, return for refund"]},{"name":"three years","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for reinstating lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within five (5) years of lapse"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period for premium payment","relational_anchors":["after the first premium","during which policy remains in force"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount required for continued coverage","relational_anchors":["any premium paid","past due premiums with interest","unpaid premium due"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["deducted from the Death Benefit"]}]},{"name":"Right to Return Policy","sentence":"If the Owner is not satisfied with the policy within 20 days of receipt, the policy may be returned to the Company.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Right to Examine Policy","Policy Refund","20-Day Review Period"],"entities":[{"name":"Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to review policy","relational_anchors":["right to examine policy"]},{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":["lifetime of the Insured","death benefit","nonpayment of premium"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer with authority over terms","relational_anchors":["authorized officer of the Company","refund of premiums paid","determine reinstatement interest"]},{"name":"Effective Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"starting point for contestability and suicide exclusion","relational_anchors":["two years from the Effective Date","suicide exclusion applies within two years"]},{"name":"20 days","type":"DATE","role":"duration for examining policy","relational_anchors":["from receipt","if not satisfied, return for refund"]},{"name":"three years","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for reinstating lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within five (5) years of lapse"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period for premium payment","relational_anchors":["after the first premium","during which policy remains in force"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount required for continued coverage","relational_anchors":["any premium paid","past due premiums with interest","unpaid premium due"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["deducted from the Death Benefit"]}]},{"name":"Right to Refund Within 20 Days","sentence":"If the policy is returned within 20 days of receipt, the Company shall issue a full refund of any premium paid.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Right to Examine Policy","Full Refund","20-Day Review Period"],"entities":[{"name":"Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to review policy","relational_anchors":["right to examine policy"]},{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":["lifetime of the Insured","death benefit","nonpayment of premium"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer with authority over terms","relational_anchors":["authorized officer of the Company","refund of premiums paid","determine reinstatement interest"]},{"name":"Effective Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"starting point for contestability and suicide exclusion","relational_anchors":["two years from the Effective Date","suicide exclusion applies within two years"]},{"name":"20 days","type":"DATE","role":"duration for examining policy","relational_anchors":["from receipt","if not satisfied, return for refund"]},{"name":"three years","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for reinstating lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within five (5) years of lapse"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period for premium payment","relational_anchors":["after the first premium","during which policy remains in force"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount required for continued coverage","relational_anchors":["any premium paid","past due premiums with interest","unpaid premium due"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["deducted from the Death Benefit"]}]},{"name":"Policy Void Upon Return","sentence":"Upon return of the policy, the policy shall be void from inception.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy cancellation","void from inception","examination period"],"entities":[{"name":"Owner","type":"PERSON","role":"party entitled to review policy","relational_anchors":["right to examine policy"]},{"name":"Insured","type":"PERSON","role":"individual covered by policy","relational_anchors":["lifetime of the Insured","death benefit","nonpayment of premium"]},{"name":"Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer with authority over terms","relational_anchors":["authorized officer of the Company","refund of premiums paid","determine reinstatement interest"]},{"name":"Effective Date","type":"CONCEPT","role":"starting point for contestability and suicide exclusion","relational_anchors":["two years from the Effective Date","suicide exclusion applies within two years"]},{"name":"20 days","type":"DATE","role":"duration for examining policy","relational_anchors":["from receipt","if not satisfied, return for refund"]},{"name":"three years","type":"PERIOD","role":"time limit for reinstating lapsed policy","relational_anchors":["within five (5) years of lapse"]},{"name":"31 days","type":"PERIOD","role":"grace period for premium payment","relational_anchors":["after the first premium","during which policy remains in force"]},{"name":"Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount required for continued coverage","relational_anchors":["any premium paid","past due premiums with interest","unpaid premium due"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payout upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["deducted from the Death Benefit"]}]},{"name":"Policy Void on Return","sentence":"Upon return of the policy, the policy shall be 