<node id="19a494bc-d5f5-44ed-9bcf-0eac2596edba">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Terms","text":" Company and the terms of the settlement options \noffered. \n \n \nOPTIONAL RIDERS  \nAccelerated Death Benefit Rider  \nThis rider provides for the early payment of a portion of the Death Benefit if the Insured is \ndiagnosed with a terminal illness with a life expectancy of 12 months or less, as certified by a \nlicensed physician. The amount payable shall not exceed 50% of the policy’s Face Amount \nand is subject to a maximum limit determined by the Company.  \nConditions for Acceleration \n To receive an accelerated benefit, the Policyowner must submit a written request and \nprovide medical documentation acceptable to the Company. The Company reserves the right \nto obtain a second medical opinion at its own expense.  \nEffect on Policy Values \n Upon payment of an accelerated benefit, the Death Benefit will be reduced by the amount \npaid, including any applicable administrative charges and interest. Any outstanding loans or \nliens on the policy will also be deducted.\n\n===== Page 10 =====\nExclusions  \nNo accelerated benefit will be paid if the terminal illness is the result of intentional \nself-inflicted injury, the participation in a felony, or war-related activities.  \nRight to Revoke  \nThe Policyowner may revoke the request for accelerated benefits at any time before the \nbenefit is paid, by providing written notice to the Company. \n \n \n \nSIGNATURES &amp; NOTICES  \nExecution of Policy This policy is executed by Sentinel Life Assurance Company at its Home \nOffice in Hartford, Connecticut, and becomes effective on the date shown in the Schedule of \nBenefits, provided the first premium has been paid and the Insured is living on that date.  \nPolicy Form Number  \nSLAC-TL2025-20YR  \nState Notices  \nThis policy may include additional state-specific notices or provisions as required by law. \nRefer to the attached endorsements or state notice pages, if any.  \nFraud Warning  \nAny person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other \nperson files an application for insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false \ninformation or conceals, for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact\n\n===== Page 11 =====\nmaterial thereto, commits a fraudulent insurance act.  \n__________________________  \nEleanor B. Raynor Chief Executive Officer \n __________________________  \nAuthorized Representative Sentinel Life Assurance Company\n","summary":"The Accelerated Death Benefit Rider allows policyholders diagnosed with a terminal illness and a life expectancy of 12 months or less to receive up to 50% of their policy’s face amount prior to death. Payment requires written request and medical verification, with the insurer retaining the right to seek a second opinion. Benefits reduce the death benefit and account for loans, liens, fees, and interest. Payments are excluded if caused by self-harm, felonies, or war. Policyowners can withdraw requests before payout. Legal warnings against fraud are included.","topics":["Life Insurance Riders","Death Benefit Acceleration","Insurance Claims Process","Policy Exclusions"],"facts":[{"name":"Issuing Entity Identification","sentence":"Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the issuing entity of the policy.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy issuance","insurer identification","company authority"],"entities":[{"name":"Sentinel Life Assurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the insurance policy","relational_anchors":["Home Office in Hartford, Connecticut","Policy Form Number SLAC-TL2025-20YR"]},{"name":"Eleanor B. Raynor","type":"PERSON","role":"Chief Executive Officer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Authorized Representative","type":"ROLE","role":"representative authorized to execute policy","relational_anchors":["Sentinel Life Assurance Company"]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"CONCEPT","role":"provision enabling early death benefit payout","relational_anchors":["terminal illness","life expectancy of 12 months or less","50% of the policy's Face Amount","maximum limit determined by the Company"]},{"name":"the date shown in the Schedule of Benefits","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Form Number SLAC-TL2025-20YR","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"unique identifier for policy form","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Hartford, Connecticut","type":"LOCATION","role":"headquarters location of insurer","relational_anchors":["Home Office of Sentinel Life Assurance Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount paid upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["Face Amount","reduced upon acceleration"]},{"name":"Face Amount","type":"FINANCIAL_CONCEPT","role":"base sum assured under policy","relational_anchors":["50% of the policy’s Face Amount"]},{"name":"written request","type":"ACTION","role":"formal submission to initiate benefit","relational_anchors":["submitted by Policyowner","before benefit payment"]},{"name":"medical documentation","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"proof required for benefit approval","relational_anchors":["acceptable to the Company","certified by licensed physician"]},{"name":"second medical opinion","type":"CONCEPT","role":"independent review requested by insurer","relational_anchors":["obtained at Company's expense"]},{"name":"intentional self-inflicted injury","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"condition preventing benefit eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"participation in a felony","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"condition preventing benefit eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"war-related activities","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"condition preventing benefit eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"right to revoke","type":"RIGHT","role":"ability to cancel benefit request","relational_anchors":["request for accelerated benefits","before benefit is paid"]},{"name":"Fraud Warning","type":"LEGAL_NOTICE","role":"legal deterrent against deceptive claims","relational_anchors":["knowingly and with intent to defraud","materially false information","conceals relevant facts"]}]},{"name":"Policy Effective Date","sentence":"The policy becomes effective on the date shown in the Schedule of Benefits.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy effectiveness","Schedule of Benefits","execution timeline"],"entities":[{"name":"Sentinel Life Assurance Company","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of the insurance policy","relational_anchors":["Home Office in Hartford, Connecticut","Policy Form Number SLAC-TL2025-20YR"]},{"name":"Eleanor B. Raynor","type":"PERSON","role":"Chief Executive Officer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Authorized Representative","type":"ROLE","role":"representative authorized to execute policy","relational_anchors":["Sentinel Life Assurance Company"]},{"name":"Accelerated Death Benefit Rider","type":"CONCEPT","role":"provision enabling early death benefit payout","relational_anchors":["terminal illness","life expectancy of 12 months or less","50% of the policy's Face Amount","maximum limit determined by the Company"]},{"name":"the date shown in the Schedule of Benefits","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Policy Form Number SLAC-TL2025-20YR","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"unique identifier for policy form","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Hartford, Connecticut","type":"LOCATION","role":"headquarters location of insurer","relational_anchors":["Home Office of Sentinel Life Assurance Company"]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"amount paid upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["Face Amount","reduced upon acceleration"]},{"name":"Face Amount","type":"FINANCIAL_CONCEPT","role":"base sum assured under policy","relational_anchors":["50% of the policy’s Face Amount"]},{"name":"written request","type":"ACTION","role":"formal submission to initiate benefit","relational_an