  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 confirms that premiums are locked at $42.00 per month for 20 years, a core feature of the policy’s stability. This permanence depends on the enforceability of written amendments, as stated in fact_sentence_1, ensuring that such guarantees cannot be unilaterally changed without proper documentation.</data>
