  <data key="d3">The 20-year premium guarantee ensures stable payments throughout the term, while the presence of an accelerated death benefit rider provides additional financial flexibility should the insured face a terminal illness. These features operate independently yet contribute to the comprehensive nature of the policy’s benefits.</data>
