  <data key="d3">The inclusion of an accelerated death benefit rider indicates enhanced benefits available under specific conditions, whereas the risk classification relates to initial underwriting evaluation and premium determination—no direct influence exists between them.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
