  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the accelerated death benefit rider adds value to the policy, which is supported by the consistent monthly premium payment of $42.00.</data>
  <data key="d4">FUNDING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3" target="ad1cb066-961b-4cae-bf88-48a316e04583">
  <data key="d3">The existence of an accelerated death benefit rider does not influence the chosen premium payment method. It is a separate feature related to payout options at end-of-life, distinct from billing logistics.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
