  <data key="d3">The inclusion of an Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables the insured to receive part of the death benefit prior to passing, should qualifying health events occur. This provision does not alter or rely on the identity of the primary beneficiary, Elaine M. Hughes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
