  <data key="d3">The existence of an accelerated death benefit rider allows the insured access to part of the policy’s death benefit if they meet certain medical criteria. This feature operates independently of the fixed premium schedule, which remains unchanged regardless of rider usage.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
