  <data key="d3">The presence of the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables the policyholder to access a portion of the death benefit prematurely upon meeting eligibility criteria, such as a terminal diagnosis with limited life expectancy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_FUNCTION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
