  <data key="d3">The presence of an Accelerated Death Benefit Rider enables early payouts for terminal illnesses, but this benefit is explicitly denied if the illness arises from war-related causes, limiting its applicability under specific circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_LIMITATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
