  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that the rider is already attached to the policy, which validates the availability described in fact_sentence_2. This indicates the rider is not just offered but implemented in practice.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
