  <data key="d3">The presence of an Accelerated Death Benefit Rider may influence decisions about changing beneficiaries, especially if the insured anticipates receiving benefits due to terminal illness. However, the timing of such changes depends solely on signature, not medical status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
