  <data key="d3">The presence of an Accelerated Death Benefit Rider may influence decisions about changing beneficiaries, especially if the insured anticipates needing early payouts due to terminal illness. However, the timing of such changes remains governed solely by signature, independent of rider activation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
