<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="1bc20fef-0219-4067-93b4-960a572af52c">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums across the term is a key feature of the policy identified by the number SLAC-2025-001.</data>
  <data key="d4">FEATURES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="4de07664-40a5-4e8c-9078-ba2e3d911267">
  <data key="d3">The assurance of level premiums throughout the term depends on the reliability and contractual obligations of the insurer, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, mentioned in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="6294aeb4-ef71-4d5d-920b-89b32721806d">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums throughout the term has no connection to the geographic location of the insurer’s main office.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="9d39db3a-2f5d-4c6b-8301-185f6aac0a50">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums across the term implies consistent financial obligations tied to the insured’s status; thus, the stable premium structure relies on the identification of Jordan Everett Hughes as the named insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="80518b2d-1bb2-4fa2-93b9-79573d720a98">
  <data key="d3">Level premiums guarantee that Jordan Everett Hughes’s financial obligation remains unchanged during the term, reinforcing the long-term commitment implied by his role as policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="8fc90088-9d80-42d0-8aba-0a66fc2bce8b">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums mean that the fixed payment of $42.00 per month remains unchanged from the policy’s effective date onward, ensuring financial predictability from day one.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="3babd2b0-2bbd-47de-9b19-fa8ac968a0d5">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums throughout the term aligns precisely with the defining feature of a level term life insurance policy, confirming its stability and fixed cost structure.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="a8f33721-10d3-4a55-bd6d-b3fe229773e9">
  <data key="d3">Level premiums ensure predictable payment costs across the term, independent of the legal jurisdiction under which the contract operates.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="1967adef-ed54-4a4b-82ca-b7fa88d7aeb7">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums across the term reflect a core provision of the legal contract between the insurer and the policy owner, defining the ongoing payment commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="3c328b68-a332-4773-9c29-f646235f7d51">
  <data key="d3">Consistent premium payments over time enable the maintenance of coverage, ensuring that the death benefit remains payable according to the policy's stipulated terms and conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="8553795c-a210-458d-bbd9-47de9966423a">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums provide the stable funding mechanism necessary for the company to honor its commitment to pay the death benefit when due.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="4c454305-8df7-4f9a-b113-fd49d2e08142">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence confirms stable payment obligations across the term, independent of how the contract's documentation is defined. It does not rely on nor explain the inclusion of documents outlined in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="1d72c661-13a0-42a4-ac28-933c7e831eec">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums across the term depend on the policy's unaltered status, meaning any deviation would require proper documentation per the clause mandating written consent from a company officer.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="44a69e56-850d-4ea1-95b8-2226d8cfc678">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums ensure consistent payments across the entire term, independent of changes in health or age. This feature operates separately from the contestability clause that applies only in the first two years.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="0d5e54d4-82aa-4712-9f7e-bdb99dc0e6ca">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums ensure that the monthly cost remains fixed at $42.00 across the term, regardless of changes in health or age. This financial predictability operates independently of coverage restrictions like the suicide exclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="3fabbb3c-c938-4f7a-ab4d-20e58b9e5b05">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums throughout the term implies consistent payment responsibility from the insured, Jordan Everett Hughes, whose identity is confirmed in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="5e40f960-de3c-481f-98c1-874810eac969">
  <data key="d3">Consistent, level premiums ensure predictable financial obligations, reinforcing the importance of accurately referencing the correct policy through its assigned number.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="835b03af-5fa4-431f-80f1-d702c4462036">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums across the term supports the characterization of the policy as a "level term" product, confirming its structural consistency.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="c446b9c8-2ed6-4125-bd61-520aaa02f788">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums across the term reflects a design choice made at issuance, which was influenced by the insured’s age of 37 when determining affordability and risk classification.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="29dbe36f-fb96-403b-9aed-0b906b3fd9d1">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums throughout the term is unrelated to the insured’s gender, as it pertains solely to financial terms rather than personal characteristics.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="f977fc63-d49f-485a-b170-30398a30ab1f">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums ensure payment consistency over time; however, this structural feature does not depend on or reflect the underlying risk classification of the insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="c60b044e-6ee5-4b98-90f3-c0a74783eec9">
  <data key="d3">Level premiums ensure consistent cost coverage over the term, making them compatible with the fixed $500,000 face amount, maintaining actuarial balance and affordability.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="dbe6ae57-ebfd-495c-82e2-7e10d5207bf3">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums across the term confirms that the initially stated $42.00 monthly payment applies consistently without increase, validating the stability of the cost from the outset.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="ad1cb066-961b-4cae-bf88-48a316e04583">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums require a stable payment mechanism like monthly bank drafts to maintain reliability and avoid fluctuations.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="a337b41c-27fd-4c74-8c49-2a45657cee74">
  <data key="d3">Because premiums are set at a fixed rate for the full 20-year term, the guaranteed period explicitly defines the timeframe during which this level pricing applies.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="b90bc020-0e6f-4387-b39e-6c2e84c74262">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums apply from the inception of coverage on August 7, 2025, ensuring consistent payment obligations over the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS FROM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="d3b72487-817b-4bd9-9c48-3e22d25ec16e">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed level premiums apply only for the duration of the term, meaning they continue until the policy's coverage terminates on August 7, 2045.</data>
  <data key="d4">GUARANTEED_DURING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="90ec6e29-a29c-4e3c-8d1b-c21dc571dc89">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of fixed monthly premiums ensures consistent cost over the term but has no bearing on the identity or status of the named beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="d13623e0-a45f-4060-82e1-dbdfcb46c827">
  <data key="d3">Monthly premiums remain fixed at $42.00 for the entire term, ensuring predictable payment obligations throughout the policy’s duration.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3">
  <data key="d3">Level premiums ensure consistent payments over the term without increase, maintaining affordability. This guarantee holds true even when additional benefits like the accelerated death benefit rider are included in the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
