  <data key="d3">The consistent premium payments over the term are ensured because they are defined within the binding conditions of the insurance contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4" target="172b9278-1d92-4151-bb1c-57052cd17f3d">
  <data key="d3">The consistent payment of premiums ensures financial commitment across the entire term, directly supporting the policy's operation until it naturally expires unless extended through renewal or conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
