  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes stable premiums over time, consistent with the guarantee emphasized in chunk_summary_2; fact_sentence_2 explains the role of beneficiaries, which contextualizes the designation made in chunk_summary_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
