  <data key="d3">The guarantee of level premiums over the term provides financial predictability, which complements the temporary right to cancel the policy within 20 days of receipt. This allows the insured time to review coverage before committing fully.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
