  <data key="d3">Guaranteed stable premiums ensure consistent payment obligations regardless of health changes, independent of the designated beneficiaries named in the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dc7d257a-6a88-40ef-9995-0d6cef3ac4dd" target="d13623e0-a45f-4060-82e1-dbdfcb46c827">
  <data key="d3">Monthly premiums remain fixed at $42.00 for the entire term, ensuring cost predictability. This detail has no bearing on the identity or role of the contingent beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dc7d257a-6a88-40ef-9995-0d6cef3ac4dd" target="b1aa54d6-2e04-4f72-a8ff-fe05054ce5b3">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed stable premiums ensure consistent payments over the term, regardless of changes in health or other factors, and do not influence whether an accelerated death benefit rider is included.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="dc7d257a-6a88-40ef-9995-0d6cef3ac4dd" target="cdb0fe5e-2332-46bf-8e3c-ce3e60450bd4">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed stable premiums ensure consistent payments throughout the term, regardless of changes in health or age; however, this has no direct bearing on the window available to reinstate a lapsed policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
