  <data key="d3">The assurance that premiums won’t increase (fact_sentence_2) implies they remain at a fixed rate, aligning with the concept of "level" premiums described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">EQUIVALENT TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
