  <data key="d3">The guarantee against premium increases ensures financial predictability throughout the term, while the 20-day examination period allows the insured to cancel the policy without penalty early on. These clauses serve complementary roles in protecting the policyholder’s interests at different stages.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
