  <data key="d3">Because the policy is a 20-year level term life insurance product, its expiration upon completion of the term is inherent to its design, making the termination clause a direct outcome of the policy’s classification.</data>
  <data key="d4">IMPLIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
