</edge>
<edge source="172b9278-1d92-4151-bb1c-57052cd17f3d" target="8553795c-a210-458d-bbd9-47de9966423a">
  <data key="d3">The expiration of coverage at the end of the term limits the window during which the promised death benefit can be claimed under the original terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITS_DURATION</data>
