  <data key="d3">Chunk 2 elaborates on several provisions introduced in chunk 1—particularly the 20-day examination period, grace period, and reinstatement—by specifying exact durations and conditions, thereby deepening understanding of the policy’s operational mechanics from the original summary’s foundation.</data>
