  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 elaborates on the policy owner’s control by detailing actionable rights such as changing beneficiaries and accessing policy features like the accelerated death benefit rider, extending the initial framework of ownership and flexibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">ELABORATES_ON</data>
