  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 elaborates on critical operational aspects—specifically premium payment schedules, grace periods, reinstatement requirements, and death benefit disbursement—that depend on the foundational structures already established, such as the fixed-term guarantee and policy effectiveness.</data>
