  <data key="d3">The reinstatement window of 5 years post-lapse ensures continuity if coverage is resumed, but it does not affect whether premiums rise during the guaranteed term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
