  <data key="d3">The reinstatement period allows revival of coverage after a lapse, but it does not affect when coverage ends if no conversion happens by the original term’s conclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The reinstatement period allows recovery of coverage after a lapse, but it does not affect when coverage ends if no renewal occurs. This statement concerns revival conditions rather than terminal events.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
