  <data key="d3">Defining the policy as comprising multiple documents—including applications and riders—necessitates that any benefit limitations referenced in other clauses must account for those included materials, ensuring consistency across the contractual framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENCOMPASSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
