  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines what makes up a complete policy, including documents like applications and riders. This structural detail provides context but does not influence or explain the purpose of designating a beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines the structural elements included in a policy, such as applications and endorsements. The second sentence specifies the financial obligation triggered by the insured's death, which is a central feature of the policy's function.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The policy comprises various formal documents, including applications, schedules, riders, and endorsements, forming its complete legal framework. The Owner possesses full ownership rights over this comprehensive set of materials, ensuring they have decision-making power across all aspects of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INCLUDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The policy encompasses various documents including applications and riders, but it does not inherently define how payments are made. This information about premiums stands independently as part of the contractual obligations under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of applications, schedules, and endorsements forms the legal framework of a policy, but this does not influence or relate directly to the timing of a grace period following a missed premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">The definition of a policy's components does not influence or relate directly to the length of the incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence outlines the legal and administrative components that make up a policy, while the second describes a procedural remedy available if the policy lapses. The connection lies only in broad policy management but not in direct logical dependency.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of applications, schedules, riders, and endorsements forms the complete policy documentation. This comprehensive set ensures clarity on coverage but does not directly affect whether the policy stays active during the grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of applications, schedules, and endorsements forms the complete policy document, while the incontestability period limits when insurers can dispute its validity after it takes effect.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application and supporting documents in the policy provides the basis upon which the insurer can evaluate claims of material misrepresentation during the contestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 identifies the components included in a Policy, while fact_sentence_2 specifies that the Entire Contract comprises exactly those same parts, confirming semantic equivalence.</data>
  <data key="d4">EQUIVALENT_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of applications, schedules, riders, and endorsements within the policy establishes what constitutes the official agreement; therefore, no external party can override or change these elements without following prescribed procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of documents like applications and riders in a policy creates the scope of what can be altered. Therefore, changes to these components require formal written approval by company officers.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application within the policy establishes it as a foundational component upon which the policy's issuance relies.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, and other documents forms the complete policy framework, which becomes active only upon receipt of the first premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The policy's composition includes the Schedule of Benefits, which contains critical information such as the effective date. Thus, knowing what constitutes the policy enables understanding where key dates like the effective date are documented.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The Policy's composition, including its formal documents and addenda, establishes the legal framework through which the Owner gains full control over the policy’s contractual rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, and other elements in the policy establishes the legal framework that governs when coverage takes effect, including the specific activation time of 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The policy's composition—including application, schedule, riders, and endorsements—as established in fact_sentence_1 provides the legal foundation upon which the obligation to pay premiums arises. Without this structural definition, the requirement for continuous premium payments could not be meaningfully enforced.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of beneficiary changes within the policy's scope relies on the policy being fully formed through documented components like applications and schedules. Without a complete policy definition, the authority to alter beneficiaries would lack foundation.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements in the Policy provides the official documentation required for the Owner to exercise rights such as cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The policy encompasses various official documents, forming the complete contractual entity. This comprehensive nature enables the policy owner to exercise control over it, including assigning it to another party.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The policy comprises formal documents including applications and endorsements, forming its legal basis. When no owner is specified, the insured automatically becomes the owner, ensuring continuity of control over the policy’s administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements forms the complete policy document, enabling the Owner’s legal right to review it during the examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The inclusion of the right to examine within the policy documents ensures that the policyholder has time to evaluate the coverage outlined in the policy package, reinforcing the completeness of the policy definition.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
