<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity that issues the policy, but its identification does not affect or explain the 5-year instatement period following a lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the company name, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, provides context for the issuer but does not affect or explain the nature of level premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the company is Sentinel Life Assurance Company provides context for the issuer but does not affect or explain the premium stability clause.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">Knowing that the company is Sentinel Life Assurance Company does not affect or explain when the coverage ends.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">Knowing that the company is Sentinel Life Assurance Company does not affect or explain when the coverage ends; it only specifies the entity responsible for the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity that administers the policy, including any renewal or conversion options, though its identification alone does not specify how those processes operate.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Knowing the insurer is Sentinel Life Assurance Company helps clarify the source of authority behind the terms governing benefits, making the applicability of those terms more concrete.</data>
  <data key="d4">AUTHORITY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 specifies that the insurer responsible for the policy is Sentinel Life Assurance Company. This identification clarifies the institutional party involved in administering the policy referenced in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">IDENTIFIES_PARTY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies the company responsible for issuing policies, but this detail is independent of the list of documents included within a policy as described in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the insurer responsible for administering the policy. The Insured is the individual whose life is protected by the coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the insurer responsible for administering the policy. This entity's existence does not affect how the Beneficiary receives the Death Benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the issuer of the policy, establishing its identity as the responsible party. This contextual detail supports the legitimacy of the policy but does not alter the meaning of the death benefit provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the insurer that issues the policy, establishing the institutional context in which ownership rights are granted. This organizational identity supports the legal foundation upon which the Owner’s rights operate.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity responsible for administering the policy, including determining how the Death Benefit is applied according to its stated terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ADMINISTERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the insurer responsible for administering the policy. The premium payments are necessary to maintain coverage but are unrelated to the identification of the company itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the issuer of the policy, but this information does not directly influence or clarify the definition of the incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity responsible for administering the policy, including offering reinstatement options when a policy lapses due to missed premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">Sentinel Life Assurance Company issues the policy, under which a grace period applies after premium due date. This ensures continuity of coverage during the grace period regardless of payment timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">IMPLIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
