<edge source="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The identification of Sentinel Life Assurance Company as the issuer establishes the institutional party responsible for administering the policy, which helps contextualize the scope of the "Entire Contract" that includes the policy documents and related materials.</data>
