  <data key="d3">The identity of the Insured—someone whose life is covered—is established within the overall documentation package that constitutes the policy, including forms and endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">INCLUDED_IN</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The Insured is the person covered by the policy, regardless of who issued it. Sentinel Life Assurance Company is the entity that provides the insurance product.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
