  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="836d7d9d-c6c3-48cf-b645-e6559ec7b525">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="6cf269ba-af30-431d-9cec-b0b5f52d11f2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="b0c8c9b1-28a9-413e-a055-52a22d377eed">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="0ef7368e-3a9e-4248-a509-408154e0da3e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="4b540675-26b3-4ec9-b026-06eb587317fb">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="da4e01dc-7078-45e3-80b5-376160891f0e">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="9d853878-b299-4b35-9f7f-8efb6bac485d">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="70f2bf77-cf51-4798-8589-bbb58e0a679b">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="f4badb4e-e14b-4c48-bd62-a46a7e693c75">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the Owner grants full ownership rights, which may influence decisions regarding reinstatement, including whether the Owner chooses to exercise the instatement period after a lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the Owner as having full ownership rights establishes governance and decision-making power over the policy. This status remains independent of whether premiums are fixed or variable during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">Ownership rights grant full control over the policy, independent of whether premiums are fixed or subject to change.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the Owner as having full ownership rights does not determine when coverage ends; termination depends solely on the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the Owner as having full ownership rights does not determine whether coverage continues beyond the term; it only establishes control over the policy’s administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of ownership rights, the Owner has the legal capacity to exercise renewal or conversion privileges specified in the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of ownership rights, the Owner controls access to benefits, which remain contingent upon adherence to the policy’s stated terms and exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses full ownership rights under the policy, meaning they hold authority over its management and benefits, which directly relates to the nature of the policy itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">HAS_RIGHTS_UNDER</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">As the holder of all ownership rights, the Owner controls every component included in the policy, such as the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements, thereby exercising authority over the entire contractual package.</data>
  <data key="d4">OWNED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the Owner as the holder of all ownership rights implies control over the policy, including decisions related to beneficiaries and premium payments, which are exercised within the framework set by the insurer, Sentinel Life Assurance Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">INSTITUTIONAL FRAMEWORK</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete ownership rights, enabling them to manage or alter aspects of the policy, including designating or changing the Insured if permitted by policy rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds full control over the policy but has no automatic claim on the Death Benefit; that right belongs solely to the designated Beneficiary. The existence of one does not influence the selection or entitlements of the other.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds full control over the policy, including decisions related to beneficiaries and benefits. The Death Benefit is determined by the policy terms and paid to the designated beneficiary when the insured passes away.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete control over the policy, enabling them to manage its terms; however, the actual amount paid out as the Death Benefit remains bound by the specific conditions outlined within the policy itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete control over the policy, but this does not directly relate to the grace period that follows a missed premium payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete control over the policy, including decisions about premium payments. However, the definition of the Owner does not inherently explain or rely upon the concept of premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The Owner has full control over the policy and ensures its continuity; during the Grace Period, the policy stays active even if a premium is late, allowing the Owner time to make up the payment without losing coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence establishes the Owner's control over the policy, while the second describes a statutory protection period unrelated to ownership roles.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses full control over the policy, including the ability to act on its behalf during processes like reinstatement after lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds full control over the policy, but this does not influence the company’s right to contest the policy during the incontestability period, which applies regardless of ownership status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete ownership rights, which are safeguarded by the rule that no agent can change or waive policy provisions, preserving the Owner’s autonomy.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROTECTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds full control over the policy, but this ownership does not affect the company’s ability to contest the policy if material misrepresentations were made during application.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete control over the policy, while the Entire Contract encompasses all official documentation forming the binding agreement. These elements together define the structural integrity of the policy’s governance and scope.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.4</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s complete ownership rights necessitate that any modification to the policy must follow official procedures, ensuring accountability and preventing unauthorized changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete control over the policy only after meeting the condition of paying the first premium, which initiates the policy’s validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The Owner holds complete control over the policy, including its management and benefits; however, the policy itself only comes into effect based on truthful representations made during the application process.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of ownership rights, the Owner is responsible for ensuring ongoing premium payments to maintain coverage. Without timely payments, the policy may lapse despite the Owner’s legal entitlements.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESPONSIBILITY_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The first sentence establishes that the Owner has complete control over the policy, but it does not explain how or when the policy begins to take effect.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's designation determines when coverage starts; since the policy's effectiveness hinges on the Owner's address and time zone, the definition of the Owner enables proper activation of coverage on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes that the Owner holds all ownership rights; fact sentence 2 reinforces this by specifying those rights include contractual authority, effectively expanding on the scope of ownership described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">Since the Owner holds all rights of ownership, they have the authority to modify key aspects of the policy, including beneficiary designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">Since the Owner holds all rights of ownership, they have the authority to initiate actions such as requesting cancellation of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete control over the policy, including the authority to transfer it through assignment. This right stems directly from the comprehensive ownership described in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Since the Owner holds all rights of ownership, they inherently possess the authority to review or examine the policy during the 20-day examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Owner establishes legal control over the policy, while the second sentence specifies what happens when no Owner is formally named—defaulting to the Insured. It ensures continuity of ownership even in absence of explicit designation.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses complete control over the policy, including the ability to act on any contractual rights, such as exercising the 20-day examination period if applicable.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="df9797d7-629e-4917-bc56-582d8cf4fe9d">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Owner's rights provides foundational context that could be relevant if the fraudulent act involved abuse of ownership powers, though no evidence links them directly.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="de0d67af-5b66-4374-8edd-cc82b199731b">
  <data key="d3">The first statement explains ownership rights in a life insurance policy, while the second introduces a corporate executive implicated in fraud at an insurer. There is no evidence linking the named individual to ownership of a specific policy described in the first summary.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="57fafae6-d83d-473d-a0a2-e4e4d1824c40">
  <data key="d3">The concept of policy ownership described in fact_sentence_1 provides foundational terminology that could apply to any insured party, but it has no explicit link to Eleanor B. Raynor’s representational role at Sentinel Life Assurance Company mentioned in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94" target="9e3cd4f3-d236-4040-a6c4-c46f3a22a611">
  <data key="d3">The first statement establishes the concept of ownership in a life insurance policy, while the second introduces Eleanor B. Raynor as an authorized representative involved in potential fraudulent activities at an insurer. There is no indication that her role connects directly to ownership rights described in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8f802f27-323c-4e93-8cb6-6ae582bb88c8" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">holds ownership rights</data>
</edge>
<edge source="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539" target="e5341fd4-d152-410c-9485-82a8f91d66c7">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">ORGANIZATION</data>
</edge>
