</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 establishes a two-year incontestability period affecting claim legitimacy, whereas fact sentence 1 ensures consistent premium costs across the term. Though both contribute to overall policy reliability, one does not affect or depend on the other.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 defines the incontestability period as lasting two years from policy issue, protecting beneficiaries against future challenges by insurers. This clause has no bearing on whether premiums are fixed or variable during the guarantee period mentioned in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year incontestability period has no bearing on whether coverage terminates at the end of the term; it pertains only to claim validity post-issue.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year incontestability period has no bearing on whether coverage terminates at the end of the term; it pertains only to claim validity during that window post-issue.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that the incontestability period lasts two years, a standalone provision unrelated to the procedural requirements for renewal or conversion mentioned in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability period exemplifies a specific term that governs when and how benefits can be contested, aligning with the overarching condition stated in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 describes the length of the incontestability period as two years, a standard feature in many policies. However, it does not reference or build upon the definition of the policy itself introduced in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year incontestability period is independent of whether the policy includes specific documents like applications or riders.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year incontestability period is a standard policy feature that applies regardless of the specific identity of the insurer, including Sentinel Life Assurance Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a timeframe during which the insurer cannot contest the validity of the policy based on misrepresentation, independent of the insured's identity or role.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence outlines a time-limited legal safeguard applicable to claims, independent of the ownership designation described in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence outlines the timeframe during which the insurer cannot challenge the policy's validity, but this has no bearing on how beneficiaries are designated, as stated in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period ensures that once two years have passed since policy issuance, the insurer cannot dispute the validity of the claim regarding the Death Benefit, thereby protecting the beneficiary's right to receive it.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability period ensures that after its expiration, the Death Benefit becomes fully enforceable unless fraud is proven.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">After two years from policy inception, the incontestability period begins, ensuring that failure to pay premiums does not invalidate benefits if death occurs later.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period establishes a two-year timeframe during which insurers cannot challenge coverage due to misstatements, regardless of whether a Grace Period was used or triggered by late payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period establishes a legal window post-issue when insurers lose the right to dispute claims, independent of whether the policy was paid during a Grace Period. This provision does not rely on or influence the operation of the Grace Period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period sets a legal window—typically two years—for insurers to challenge coverage due to misstatements; it does not affect whether a lapsed policy can be reinstated.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The two-year Incontestability Period sets the time frame during which the insurance company retains the right to dispute the policy's validity based on inaccuracies in the application.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINES_WINDOW</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The two-year incontestability period establishes the timeframe during which the insurer can challenge the policy due to material misrepresentations made at application.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period establishes a timeframe within which insurers cannot challenge policy validity due to misstatements; this limitation applies specifically to the documents included in the Entire Contract, ensuring clarity about what is legally binding.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year incontestability period sets a timeframe for potential challenges by insurers, but this has no bearing on whether agents can modify policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a two-year incontestability period ensures that after this time, the insurer generally cannot challenge the policy's validity due to misstatements. This provision operates independently of whether changes to the policy require formal written approval by a company officer.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period starts after the policy is issued, which requires the payment of the first premium. Without the first premium, the policy—and thus the incontestability period—does not begin.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period limits the insurer’s ability to dispute coverage due to inaccuracies in the application after two years from issuance. This ensures that once the policy has been active for two years, the insured or beneficiary can rely on its validity regardless of prior application errors.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period defines a legal window after which insurers cannot challenge the policy's validity, but it does not affect whether ongoing coverage requires timely premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a legal window after which insurers lose the ability to deny claims due to misstatements. This does not affect the policyowner’s authority to modify beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period starts upon the Effective Date of the policy, meaning its duration depends on when coverage officially begins. This temporal connection allows the two facts to be interpreted together within the timeline of the policy’s lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a timeframe during which insurers cannot dispute coverage due to misstatements. This does not affect the policyowner’s right to hold and exercise all contractual powers over the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a two-year window during which the insurer cannot challenge the policy's validity due to misstatements. This timeframe operates independently of when coverage actually starts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a time limit during which insurers may challenge policy validity due to misstatements. This clause operates independently of the policyowner’s ability to assign the policy to another party.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a timeframe after which insurers cannot dispute the policy’s validity due to misstatements. This does not affect the policyowner’s ability to voluntarily cancel the policy at any time.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period refers to a two-year window during which the insurer cannot contest the validity of the policy based on misrepresentations. This clause operates separately from ownership designation rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period establishes a timeframe during which insurers cannot challenge the policy's validity due to misstatements. This provision operates independently of the Owner’s right to examine the policy, though both serve protective functions for the policyholder.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period establishes a timeframe during which the insurer cannot challenge the validity of the policy based on misrepresentation, while the right to examine allows cancellation within 20 days of receiving the policy. These are separate safeguards operating at different points in the policy lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
