  <data key="d3">The incontestability period enables the insurer to challenge the policy’s legitimacy; however, this right operates independently of the reinstatement window after a lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">The existence of an incontestability period, during which the insurer can challenge the policy’s validity, has no bearing on whether premiums remain level over the guaranteed term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period allows the insurer to verify policy accuracy early on; however, this does not impact the fixed nature of premiums throughout the guaranteed term.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The existence of the incontestability period limits when the company can dispute the policy’s validity, thereby affecting how long the insured remains protected from retroactive denial despite potential issues discovered post-issue.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period allows the insurer to verify the accuracy of information provided when applying for the policy; however, once that period ends, the policy remains enforceable even if misrepresentations were made—regardless of whether it has terminated under its original term.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The existence of an incontestability period limits when the insurer can challenge the policy’s validity but has no bearing on whether renewal or conversion is permitted per contract terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
