  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability period limits when insurers can challenge policy validity; however, this restriction does not alter the requirement to pay premiums to sustain coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_EFFECT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
