  <data key="d3">The Incontestability Period grants the insurer limited power to dispute the policy’s legitimacy after it has been in effect for a specified duration. This timeframe operates separately from the Grace Period, which pertains only to premium delinquency.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
