  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 describes the time-limited window during which the insurer can dispute the policy’s validity based on misrepresentation. Fact sentence 2 specifies that any change to the policy terms must be formally documented by authorized personnel.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
