  <data key="d3">The incontestability period depends on the policy’s effective date; once the policy becomes effective, the company gains the right to contest its validity within a specified timeframe. This establishes temporal linkage between the effective date and the onset of legal protections.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
