  <data key="d3">The incontestability period allows the insurer to verify policy accuracy but does not affect the owner’s assignment rights. This clause operates independently of ownership transfers.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
