  <data key="d3">The incontestability period allows the insurer to verify policy accuracy but does not affect the owner’s right to cancel. This clause limits future disputes by the insurer but operates independently of the owner’s cancellation authority.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
