  <data key="d3">The "Entire Contract" explicitly incorporates the "Policy" as its foundational element alongside other supporting documents.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that the Entire Contract includes the policy, application, and attachments; fact_sentence_1 reinforces this by defining the Policy itself as including those exact items.</data>
  <data key="d4">EQUIVALENT_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the "Entire Contract" encompasses the policy itself, the application, and any attachments—this legally binding set of documents would naturally involve Sentinel Life Assurance Company as the contracting party.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The statement regarding the Entire Contract sets forth the official documentation forming the policy’s basis, independent of defining roles like that of the Insured.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract specifies what constitutes the legally binding agreement, including materials that may affect ownership rights held by the Owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.4</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">The scope of the Entire Contract includes formal definitions such as the Beneficiary, ensuring clarity on who is entitled to the Death Benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INCLUDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract includes essential elements like the Death Benefit, ensuring clarity about what forms the binding agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract—encompassing the policy, application, and attachments—is essential because it determines how elements like the Death Benefit are interpreted and enforced under the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNDERLIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract encompasses formal documentation including the policy and application, thereby establishing the context in which premium payments become legally binding duties.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The Entire Contract outlines the official components of the policy agreement, which do not influence the operational mechanics of the Grace Period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract includes foundational documents that establish policy terms; however, this does not affect how the policy behaves during the Grace Period when coverage persists post-due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The Entire Contract clause specifies the official components of the policy agreement, independent of whether reinstatement processes apply after lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">The Entire Contract includes key documents like the application and riders, which form the basis upon which the Incontestability Period operates by defining the scope of information subject to review over the two-year window.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENCOMPASSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the entire contract includes key components that could influence whether claims are contested during the incontestability period, linking formal documentation to potential challenges over policy validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">Because the Entire Contract includes the application, it establishes the basis upon which the company can later challenge the policy if material misrepresentations are found.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract ensures that only officially recorded documents form the binding agreement; this prevents agents from unilaterally altering those documents, preserving the contract’s formal boundaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract sets the foundational scope of what constitutes the binding agreement; therefore, any modification to its elements must follow strict procedural requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The policy exists because it was issued based on the application; therefore, the content of the application forms part of the legal basis for the policy itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The Entire Contract defines the official scope of the policy, including its conditions. Timely premium payments are essential to maintain coverage under this contractual framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract establishes the foundational documents that determine the validity and scope of the policy, including the schedule showing its Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The policy's status as the "Entire Contract," encompassing the application and related documents, provides the foundational framework that validates the issuance of the policy upon payment of the first premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract establishes the foundational documentation required for the policy to take effect; without it, coverage cannot legally commence.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract sets the foundational framework by specifying all components included in the binding agreement. This directly enables the Policy Owner’s possession of all contractual rights, as they are granted through inclusion in the formal contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract encompasses all binding components of the policy, including provisions related to ownership rights. This foundational clause enables the explicit recognition of the Owner’s authority to assign the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract encompasses all binding components of the policy, including provisions related to ownership rights. This foundational clause enables the Policy Owner to exercise control over beneficiary designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The Entire Contract provision establishes that the policy documents collectively form the binding agreement; this foundational definition enables clarity around roles like Owner, including cases where one isn't specified.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract sets the legal scope of the agreement, including the policy document. This foundational clause enables the Owner’s right to examine the policy, ensuring transparency within the documented contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract establishes the official scope of the policy, providing the legal basis upon which the Policy Owner’s right to cancel is grounded. Without clearly defining what constitutes the contract, the authority to terminate would lack procedural clarity.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The definition of the Entire Contract provides the foundational documents subject to the 20-day examination period, ensuring the policyholder has access to all binding components during review.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
