  <data key="d3">The need for written approval by a company officer does not affect how long the reinstatement window lasts after a lapse; they address separate operational rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
