  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance hinges on truthful representations in the application, ensuring legitimacy. These disclosures directly inform the determination of fixed premiums, making the guarantee of level rates contingent upon accurate data submission.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">Accurate application statements are required for the policy to be issued, ensuring legitimacy; meanwhile, once issued, premiums are locked in and cannot rise during the guaranteed term, providing long-term cost predictability regardless of application content.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">Accurate statements in the application ensure the policy remains active until the end of the term; without them, the policy may be invalidated before termination occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The policy was granted based on the truthfulness of the application, meaning its continuation until expiration hinges on proper disclosure upfront. Misrepresentation could invalidate the policy before it even reaches its term limit.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.55</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance relies on accurate application content, which may impact future options like renewal or conversion if misrepresentations exist.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
