  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance relies on accurate application statements, meaning any inaccuracies may result in excluded benefits per policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
