  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance is contingent upon accurate disclosures made during the application process, which underpins how the policy is legally recognized and established.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
