  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance hinges on truthful representations in the application, forming the basis of contractual legitimacy. This foundational requirement exists separately from how the policy functions after issue, including its grace period rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
