  <data key="d3">The policy is contingent upon truthful representations in the application, making accurate disclosures essential at inception. Without this condition, the incontestability period would not apply, as the policy itself hinges on the integrity of initial statements.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
