  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance relies entirely on the honesty and completeness of the applicant’s declarations; if those were materially false, it enables the company to challenge the policy’s enforceability.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
