  <data key="d3">The policy’s issuance hinges on truthful application statements, which form the basis for determining eligibility and premium rates. Continued coverage remains contingent upon fulfilling financial obligations, including regular premium payments, ensuring the insurer’s risk assumption remains valid over time.</data>
