  <data key="d3">The requirement for the first premium payment serves as the trigger for issuing the policy, making it possible only if premiums are set at a consistent rate over time; without level premiums, the initiation process could not rely on a standardized expectation.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
