  <data key="d3">The commencement of coverage at a specific time on the Effective Date is independent of whether premiums are fixed or subject to change later.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The coverage duration concludes at the close of the fifth year, meaning it has a finite lifespan beginning exactly at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The coverage period concludes at the close of the fifth year unless conversion occurs, meaning the initial activation described in fact_sentence_2 leads into a finite timeframe governed by the policy’s term limits.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The timing of coverage commencement at 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the Effective Date sets the foundational event for benefit eligibility, while the rule about renewals or conversions requiring adherence to contract terms governs possible extensions beyond the original term. The first statement marks the beginning of protection; the second outlines options available after expiration, if applicable.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date means that benefit eligibility hinges entirely on whether the insured meets the requirements described in the policy’s terms and exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The commencement of coverage at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date occurs only after defining the policy itself as the binding contractual agreement; without this definition, the specific timing would lack contextual reference.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIMED_BY_DEFINITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The precise commencement of coverage at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date relies on the formal documentation outlined in the policy, such as the application and schedule, which define the policy’s effective timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The start of coverage at 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the Effective Date depends on the existence of an issuer—the Sentinel Life Assurance Company—which enables the policy to take effect under its authority.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The start time of coverage relies on identifying the Insured, as it determines when protection officially begins for the designated person.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at 12:01 A.M. Standard Time at the Owner’s address confirms that the Owner has control over the policy’s start date, reinforcing the significance of the Owner’s role in triggering benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">Policy coverage starts at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, meaning the Beneficiary can only receive the Death Benefit if the insured dies after this point and the policy remains in force.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date enables the potential activation of the Death Benefit if the insured dies during the covered period.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The commencement of coverage at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date triggers the enforceability of the Death Benefit under the policy’s terms, making it relevant to the scope of benefits payable upon insured's death after this point.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The start time of coverage is contingent upon the policy remaining in force, which requires regular premium payments to maintain validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">Coverage begins precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the effective date regardless of any grace period related to premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date establishes the precise moment when benefits become available, which aligns with the timeframe during which the Grace Period operates.</data>
  <data key="d4">COORDINATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The commencement of coverage at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date sets the baseline for when protection exists, regardless of whether reinstatement later restores prior lapses.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">Coverage commences precisely at 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the effective date at the owner’s address, marking the beginning of protection under the policy regardless of the incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 defines the moment coverage takes effect based on the Effective Date. This temporal milestone sets the stage for subsequent policy protections, including limitations like the incontestability period that begin from the same date. However, it does not determine or alter the existence or length of that period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The commencement of coverage at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date sets the timeline during which any misrepresentations could become relevant for contestation, but it does not influence the company’s right to challenge the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at a specific time relies on the prior establishment of the Entire Contract, ensuring all necessary documents are finalized and binding.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The specified start time of coverage hinges on the policy’s immutable terms, meaning it cannot be adjusted by agents or representatives, as stated in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date sets the activation timeline for protection, regardless of any administrative processes required for altering the policy, including obtaining written authorization from a company officer.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">While coverage begins exactly at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, this event only takes effect if the policy was lawfully issued based on the applicant’s representations in the application.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">Coverage commencing at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date implies that the policy has already been issued, contingent upon prior payment of the first premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESULT_OF_ISSUANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">Coverage does not begin until the specified effective date; therefore, any obligations related to continuing coverage through premium payments arise only after this initial activation.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">Coverage commences at 12:01 A.M. Standard Time on the Effective Date, meaning the start time is contingent upon the effective date specified in the Schedule of Benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">SETS_TIMING_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">Coverage beginning at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date marks the moment the Owner gains enforceable rights under the policy, ensuring alignment between the start of protection and the assumption of ownership privileges.</data>
  <data key="d4">COINCIDES_WITH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">Coverage initiation at the specified time enables the Owner to exercise control over the policy, including assigning it. The start of coverage marks the point at which ownership rights become actionable.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">Coverage activation occurs precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date at the Owner’s address, establishing the timeline during which the Owner gains full entitlements under the policy, including the power to designate or alter beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The start time of coverage depends on the designated Effective Date and the Owner’s address. This detail assumes an Owner has been identified; otherwise, the Insured automatically becomes the Owner under default rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ASSUMPTION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">Coverage activation occurs precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, establishing the timeline during which the Policy Owner gains full control over the policy, including the right to initiate cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Coverage initiation depends on the Owner having had sufficient opportunity to review the policy beforehand. The 20-day examination period ensures the Owner can evaluate the policy terms before coverage starts.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">Coverage commencement occurs precisely at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, marking the point when protection takes effect. This follows within the broader context of a 20-day examination period during which the policyholder may review and potentially cancel the policy after receiving it.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e1099c90-ea31-42b8-b636-436f7a11fe2b" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
