<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e">
  <data key="d3">As the policy owner has full control over the policy, they retain the right to reinstate it during the 5-year window after lapse, regardless of who initiated the action.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of contractual rights, the Policy Owner has the authority to manage the policy, including ensuring timely payment of premiums. The guarantee of level premiums enhances the owner’s capacity to fulfill obligations reliably and sustainably.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of all contractual rights, the Policy Owner has the authority to maintain consistent premium payments, directly enabling the guarantee of non-increasing premiums throughout the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of contractual rights, the Policy Owner determines whether to renew or let the policy terminate upon reaching its five-year term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy owner holds all contractual rights, they have the power to decide whether to convert the policy upon expiration, thereby influencing whether coverage continues beyond the initial term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">Since the policy owner has exclusive contractual rights, they have the authority to exercise options like renewal or conversion within the bounds set by the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s exclusive right to contractual powers allows them to govern how benefits are applied, directly influencing whether benefits are paid according to the specified terms and exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">GOVERNS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">Because the Policy Owner holds all contractual rights, they have authority over the policy’s terms, including decisions related to coverage, beneficiaries, and modifications—all grounded in the existence and nature of the underlying policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS_RIGHTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">Because the Policy encompasses binding documentation like applications and riders, it legally empowers the Owner to exercise all associated contractual rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">DERIVES_FROM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s possession of all contractual rights implies that they hold legal standing within the framework established by Sentinel Life Assurance Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 states that the Policy Owner has full contractual authority, which makes sense only when paired with knowing whom the policy covers—the Insured—as the beneficiary of those rights typically depends on the insured’s status.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 affirms the Policy Owner’s possession of all contractual rights, which aligns directly with fact sentence 1’s assertion that the Owner holds all ownership rights, implying consistency across definitions.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner holds full authority over the policy, including the right to determine who receives the Death Benefit by naming or modifying the Beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of contractual rights, the Policy Owner has the authority to determine how the Death Benefit is handled upon the insured’s passing.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTROLS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">As the Policy Owner has exclusive control over the policy, they hold authority over decisions affecting the Death Benefit, ensuring compliance with the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of contractual rights, the Policy Owner bears the responsibility of paying premiums to prevent policy lapse and ensure continued protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">OBLIGATES_TO_PAY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">As the policyowner has full contractual rights, they can utilize the 31-day grace period to avoid termination after missing a payment, ensuring continuity of benefits through exercised ownership privileges.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of all contractual rights, the policy owner has the power to maintain the policy through timely actions, including paying premiums before expiration of the grace period, thereby preserving its status.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s possession of all contractual rights enables them to exercise options like reinstatement when a policy lapses.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">The policyowner holds complete legal rights to manage the policy, including making changes and claiming benefits. This broad ownership status operates independently of the timing constraints imposed by the incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has full control over the policy, including its use and management; however, this authority does not extend to overriding the insurer’s legal ability to contest the policy during the specified incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_DIRECT_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner holding all contractual rights means they have the authority to manage the policy, including potentially responding to or challenging any contest by the company regarding misrepresentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO DIRECT RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">Because the Policy Owner has all contractual rights, they are entitled to the benefits and responsibilities outlined in the Entire Contract, which includes the policy itself, the application, and any attachments.</data>
  <data key="d4">DERIVES_FROM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy owner holds all contractual rights, they are the sole entity empowered to enforce or interpret the policy, including its unalterable nature enforced by the restriction on agent waivers.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy owner holds all contractual rights, they have the standing to request alterations; however, such requests must still comply with the need for explicit written authorization from the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">Because the policy owner has exclusive contractual rights, they are the natural party whose application statements form the basis for issuing the policy, ensuring alignment between responsibility and entitlement.</data>
  <data key="d4">DERIVES_FROM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">Because the Policy Owner has exclusive contractual authority, they are entitled to fulfill obligations such as paying the first premium, thereby initiating the policy’s validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">As the sole holder of contractual rights, the Policy Owner has the responsibility and authority to ensure premiums are paid promptly to sustain coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">MANDATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has full contractual rights irrespective of when the policy takes effect; thus, the effective date does not alter or rely upon ownership status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">As the Policy Owner holds all contractual rights, those rights become fully operative precisely when coverage starts at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date, establishing immediate legal authority upon policy commencement.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s comprehensive control over the policy enables them to modify beneficiary designations at any time during the policy's term.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner’s possession of all contractual rights enables them to exercise control over key actions, including requesting cancellation of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner's comprehensive control over the policy enables them to exercise specific rights, including assigning it to another party. This assignment right is a direct manifestation of the broad authority held by the owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner has exclusive control over the policy’s rights; if no Owner is designated, the Insured automatically assumes those rights by default.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINES_DEFAULT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Since the Policy Owner holds all contractual rights, they inherently have the authority to inspect the policy documents during the examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner's possession of all contractual rights includes the ability to exercise the 20-day examination period, making it a direct extension of ownership control.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4764745f-34f8-4b11-8331-2737da3cfc1f" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">possesses</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0f9ddecf-62e6-4858-98d9-804568991d94" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">possesses</data>
</edge>
<edge source="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4" target="7b525877-d673-4922-a432-674d270709e2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">ORGANIZATION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4" target="b0866287-e630-42af-a4d9-7f94922ed9dd">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
