  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="626bf8dd-a1a3-42b8-b239-91b5d14fb634">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="b035d03f-8523-45d4-a72f-bce290606fd9">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="da7220f0-5b68-4a54-9024-a5335e5e9569">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="1d3107de-ba49-4598-8ef0-8f6e3f287fcc">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="25ff1fd5-51eb-491a-b104-b754dbf7a5d9">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="9418d0ba-555b-4c5d-8441-26ea7281f9e4">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="7c6ce27d-e32c-4a26-b756-56ccd18b4857">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="9e05a432-8c35-4f12-a21c-ca5eb3fe94e1">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e">
  <data key="d3">Ownership determination by default does not impact the duration of the instatement period following a lapse; they address separate procedural elements.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">The rule that the Insured becomes the default Owner if none is named establishes legal control rights; however, it has no bearing on whether premiums remain level throughout the term.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">The rule assigning ownership to the Insured in absence of a designated Owner has no bearing on whether premiums remain fixed over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The default rule that the Insured becomes the Owner in absence of a named Owner has no bearing on whether coverage ends at the term's conclusion; it pertains solely to ownership status.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">Ownership default rules based on lack of designated Owner have no bearing on whether coverage ends at the term's conclusion; they address separate administrative conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The rule that the Insured becomes the Owner by default if none is named does not affect how renewal or conversion options are governed by the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Ownership defaults to the Insured when unassigned, ensuring someone has legal standing to act on behalf of the policy’s beneficiaries, even though final benefit disbursement remains bound by policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_CONTROL</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is specified, the Insured defaults to owning the policy—a provision only meaningful within the context of defining what constitutes a "Policy." Therefore, this rule presupposes the prior establishment of the policy's identity.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">When the insured is also the owner—defaulted if unassigned—their authority stems from the comprehensive nature of the policy, which includes binding elements like applications and endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is formally appointed, the Insured assumes ownership by default. This provision applies regardless of the identity of the insurer, including Sentinel Life Assurance Company.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The default ownership rule relies on the identity of the Insured; thus, defining the Insured makes the ownership condition actionable and complete.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is named, the Insured assumes ownership rights; thus, the second statement logically extends or conditions the scope of the first by defining a default case for ownership assignment.</data>
  <data key="d4">FALLBACK_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is explicitly named, the Insured automatically becomes the Owner. This rule governs control over the policy but does not affect how the Death Benefit is distributed to the Beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">If no owner is designated, the insured automatically becomes the owner, regardless of how the death benefit is structured or paid out.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">When the Insured is automatically considered the Owner due to lack of designation, they assume responsibility for decisions related to the Death Benefit under the policy’s governing terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence determines ownership by defaulting to the insured if no owner is named. This ownership role may affect decisions around premium payments, but the statement itself does not reference or require information from the first sentence regarding what a premium is.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">If no Owner is specified, the Insured automatically becomes the Owner by default. This rule operates regardless of whether the policy includes a grace period for missed payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">If no owner is designated, the insured automatically becomes the owner, regardless of whether the policy is currently in a grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is designated, the Insured automatically becomes the Owner. This rule applies regardless of whether the policy has been reinstated or remains inactive.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">When no owner is designated, the insured automatically becomes the owner, ensuring clear control over the policy. This rule stands independent of temporal protections like the incontestability period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">When no owner is designated, the insured automatically becomes the owner; however, this rule has no bearing on whether the insurer can later contest the policy’s validity under the incontestability provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The default assignment of ownership to the insured when no owner is named has no bearing on the company’s right to contest the policy based on misrepresentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is designated, the Insured automatically assumes ownership—this rule operates within the scope of the Entire Contract, ensuring consistent interpretation across policy components.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is designated, the Insured becomes the Owner by default; this assignment does not override the prohibition on altering policy provisions stated in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">Ownership defaults to the insured if unassigned, independent of any procedural rules governing alterations or waivers requiring company approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">When no owner is designated, the insured automatically becomes the owner, which affects how application statements are interpreted regarding authority and responsibility during underwriting.</data>
  <data key="d4">IMPLIED_CONSEQUENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">Ownership defaults to the insured if unassigned, ensuring continuity of control regardless of whether the first premium has been paid. This provision does not rely on or affect the timing or necessity of the initial premium payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">Ownership determination by defaulting to the Insured has no bearing on whether future premiums must be paid to maintain coverage. The rule about ownership applies independently of financial responsibilities outlined in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">Even if the insured is automatically considered the owner under default conditions, this does not affect how or when the policy's effective date is established.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is explicitly named, the Insured is treated as the Owner, enabling them to trigger or control aspects of coverage commencement, including its effective date and time.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is named, the Insured inherits ownership and thereby gains all contractual rights associated with the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">IMPLIES_RIGHTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is specified, the Insured becomes the Owner, thereby gaining control over key policy decisions including changing beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">When no Owner is named, the Insured becomes the Owner, thereby gaining the legal capacity to assign the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">When the Insured is not formally named as Owner, they legally assume ownership status, granting them the authority to initiate cancellation under the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">If no Owner is named, the Insured automatically becomes the Owner, thereby gaining the legal standing necessary to exercise the right to examine the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The absence of a named Owner results in the Insured automatically becoming the Owner, but this does not affect the 20-day right to examine the policy after receipt.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1b084077-c9dc-4886-b79d-a9b88b22163f" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is_default_owner_when_no_owner_named</data>
</edge>
