  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="2c0030ce-18bb-412b-8194-926bb1b268f5">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="48715d73-9e87-4d90-b1f3-68462be19995">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="8bcf9835-da2d-44f1-ad1f-b49bc1e101ee">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="394262bd-fa36-4159-8f14-fd8cc5e0e5e2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="7eb302f0-67db-4aab-b305-a2fcdfe3a4a6">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="8dff110c-660f-4f64-9cdf-459897fb7d50">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f07b2890-ed75-4f8e-bddf-2349828e37ea">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6c526b4b-651f-4a2c-b4ad-6035366bf0bd">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="ab52511f-23c9-45d3-94de-8981f1813b12">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy allows them to review its contents prior to acceptance or during the cooling-off period. This right operates independently of when reinstatement may occur post-lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy provides a critical opportunity to assess coverage and terms—including premium structures—but does not alter the guarantee of level premiums during the term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's ability to examine the policy provides transparency prior to commitment, whereas the fixed premium clause ensures cost certainty throughout the term. Neither fact influences the validity or operation of the other.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can assess its terms—including whether it includes renewal options—before committing, though this does not influence the automatic termination upon term expiry.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy enables them to assess whether they wish to continue coverage beyond the initial term; however, it does not influence the automatic termination upon term expiry.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy provides them with an opportunity to understand its terms—including renewal and conversion clauses—before making any decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Because benefits depend on adherence to policy terms, the Owner’s right to examine the policy allows them to confirm the validity and scope of those terms prior to commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy implies they need to know what the policy is; thus, defining the policy's identity supports the legitimacy of this right.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's right to examine the policy implies that the policy must exist as a documented entity composed of multiple parts, including the application, schedule, riders, and endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy implies that the issuing company, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, must provide access to the policy documents within the specified timeframe.</data>
  <data key="d4">IMPLIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses the right to examine the policy, which includes reviewing its coverage on the Insured—the person whose life is protected by the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy confirms the Owner’s control over the document, reinforcing their role as the legal holder of all ownership rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">The Owner possesses the legal right to inspect the policy, enabling oversight of key elements such as the named Beneficiary and associated benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy allows them to verify critical elements such as the Death Benefit prior to finalizing coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can assess key elements like the Death Benefit before finalizing acceptance, allowing informed decision-making about coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy enables evaluation of its financial obligations, including premium requirements, before agreeing to maintain it through payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures informed consent before commitment, independent of later grace period provisions for late payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy allows them to assess its contents prior to commitment; however, this right operates independently of whether the policy is active during a grace period.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy provides them with time to assess its terms before committing, potentially leading to decisions about reinstating a previously lapsed policy if needed.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy enables them to assess its contents prior to commitment. This right exists regardless of the Incontestability Period, which applies later if any disputes arise after the policy is issued.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy provides opportunity for due diligence before binding agreement, whereas the incontestability clause limits future challenges by the insurer once that period expires. They function separately in the lifecycle of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy enables them to assess its contents, including identifying possible material misrepresentations that could trigger the company’s right to contest the policy after issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">PREVENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's right to examine the policy implies access to one component of the Entire Contract, reinforcing the importance of the contract's composition as outlined in the prior statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy relies on the assurance that no one—including agents—can override or nullify this right through unauthorized modifications.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for express written authorization by a company officer ensures that any proposed change to the policy is formally approved. The Owner’s ability to examine the policy first provides context for evaluating what changes might be made, but does not override the need for official consent.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy supports their capacity to assess whether the stated conditions align with the application, thereby validating the foundation upon which the policy was issued.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy exists only after the policy is formally issued, which requires the payment of the first premium as stated in the prior fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's ability to examine the policy provides transparency into its conditions, including premium requirements, thereby supporting compliance with the obligation to pay premiums regularly.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can assess its terms prior to the effective date, meaning the effective date marks the deadline by which any cancellation or decision must occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy enables informed consent prior to coverage becoming effective, ensuring they understand obligations and benefits before protection commences.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy stems from the Owner’s comprehensive control over the policy, including full ownership rights established by the contract.</data>
  <data key="d4">DERIVES_FROM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The opportunity to examine the policy enables the owner to understand its terms, including their authority to modify beneficiaries accordingly.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy supports potential future actions like assignment, providing necessary information prior to exercising that right.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The opportunity to examine the policy enables the owner to evaluate its terms, including potential risks or benefits that may inform a future cancellation decision.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy is granted exclusively to the Owner; therefore, the designation or assumption of ownership through the absence of a named Owner ensures access to this privilege.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0">
  <data key="d3">The Owner's right to examine the policy is limited to a 20-day window beginning upon receipt, ensuring timely review before commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">TIME_LIMITS_RIGHT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness of its terms prior to acceptance, enabling informed decisions about future actions like changing the Beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="6903f2e1-fcf8-476e-af64-83ccd3093b64">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness before committing, enabling informed decisions about beneficiary designations that take effect upon signing.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="4f081890-55f2-4345-893f-c638987334c2">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness of its terms, enabling them to make informed decisions about changing beneficiaries without relying on assumptions about the Insured’s condition at the time of submission.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f0a5245e-9eeb-422b-b2ca-4304e824a7be">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness necessary to make informed decisions about beneficiary changes, supporting transparency prior to action.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_ACTION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures they can review its contents prior to making binding decisions, enabling them to fully understand the implications before choosing to assign it.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness prior to commitment, enabling informed decisions about future actions like changing beneficiaries, which can occur independently of the Insured’s condition once initiated.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">The Owner’s right to examine the policy ensures awareness prior to committing, enabling informed decisions about whether to proceed; this autonomy directly supports the later ability to cancel the policy at any time without penalty.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy is strengthened by the ability to request a copy, ensuring the owner can review its contents thoroughly before commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The owner’s right to examine the policy supports informed decision-making regarding beneficiary designations, ensuring transparency before finalizing changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy supports the owner’s ability to review detailed records, including premium payment history, ensuring transparency and informed decision-making regarding policy management.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">The right to examine the policy allows the owner to review its terms before commitment, enabling informed decisions about requesting supplementary benefits like riders. This foundational right supports the subsequent authority to customize the policy through add-ons.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="af242c28-093a-4b30-b9cc-aa8f1e332f09" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has_right_to_examine</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ab52511f-23c9-45d3-94de-8981f1813b12" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">can be examined</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="3038e374-99ec-4f9a-bc29-31fa806447e0">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">ORGANIZATION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="c53464df-90ca-4075-a934-cfba2d28a9d0">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="0774ace7-9829-4828-9e47-e5e2b4c78d10">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="46f00767-2c30-454d-a023-d479a887f11b">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="bcd42832-32e5-492d-bf89-3b6eefa01093">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="5747912a-b3a7-4db2-b23b-27b9451b9a51">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="276ad100-a313-4431-bdae-07698456cb00">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="f90115cc-51d3-4c10-bf2a-67629e055aa0">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="0038f5f2-9807-4267-8cf1-2f54d79491b0">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="f3ba8c6f-65f7-4508-901d-58c5889638ab">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="1089e31b-1106-43f2-b07c-083d57c1473a">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="8ab463db-b8f0-42f0-b410-afeed77858ac">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="50041418-15c9-451c-b277-3482607fb1df">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="32cc14dc-f185-40a1-b8fb-0ad86cc4416e">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables cancellation if the policyholder is unsatisfied after receiving the policy, regardless of whether the policy has been previously reinstated or remains active.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="73d6a0f7-3a12-49ab-8197-b9ddcf6268d3">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 describes the 20-day examination window enabling the policyholder to review and cancel the policy if unsatisfied. This right exists regardless of premium structure, meaning it does not rely on or affect whether premiums are level.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="ffa8734c-36ec-49dc-aca1-efd25349e88a">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period gives the policyholder a chance to assess whether the fixed premium structure aligns with their expectations before committing fully.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="bf239f1e-143c-4033-9908-3fd3008ea579">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to terminate or reject the policy before its terms—including eventual termination at the end of the term—are fully enforceable.</data>
  <data key="d4">POSTPONES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="b0b717e1-fe2d-4c8b-9cf6-9744f1fe04ce">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder time to review the policy before commitment, independent of whether coverage continues beyond the initial term.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="691ac7f0-573b-4d26-abde-28f5eabaea4f">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder time to review and potentially void the policy before commitment; it has no direct bearing on later actions like renewal or conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that all benefits adhere to the policy’s terms and exclusions justifies the existence of the 20-day examination period, enabling the policyholder to evaluate those very terms before commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="42f4b018-315c-49b6-a097-7db245ea5c4a">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period exists specifically to allow the policyholder to evaluate the individual term life insurance contract they have entered into.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="60830010-3081-43cc-889f-dacd9c3bee07">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period exists specifically so the policyholder can assess the full set of materials included in the policy, including applications, schedules, and endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="7f99ae4d-301d-4e94-ac84-b8b363a2497d">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period requires the insurer, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, to allow cancellation if requested within that timeframe after receiving the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="1d0d3536-a9fe-4662-85e5-dbb9cc333be7">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to evaluate the policy, including its core elements such as the Insured, before committing to it permanently.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELEVANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="bc216732-e99f-411e-a7bb-6d75de3cce94">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period grants the policyholder the opportunity to void the policy, a right that could be exercised by the Owner due to their full ownership status.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="35280027-764e-4dc6-8e92-4ecfb705c539">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to assess whether they wish to proceed with the policy, including its terms involving beneficiaries. This window precedes final binding but does not alter the beneficiary's role once established.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="6c97dbd6-9f74-4d6a-8dfc-ae292108fb75">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination right enables the policyholder to evaluate and possibly reject the policy before commitment, regardless of how the Death Benefit is structured.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to review and reject the policy before it takes legal effect, thereby determining whether the Death Benefit clause becomes active.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="f57a074b-320b-46ff-87df-0bfd1ce1e327">
  <data key="d3">During the 20-day examination period, the policyholder may choose not to make any premium payments if dissatisfied, effectively preventing them from becoming obligated to pay until they affirmatively accept the policy by continuing beyond that window.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to review and potentially void the policy upon receipt; however, once that period ends, any subsequent missed premium triggers the separate 31-day grace period instead.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="73bb717f-ccc3-4d83-a6ca-8ece25be0884">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period grants the policyholder the right to cancel the policy without penalty shortly after receipt. It precedes any obligation to pay premiums and exists independently of later grace periods.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="5e10d7d2-9369-45f7-b96c-869e9315411d">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to review and cancel the policy upon receipt without penalty. It occurs early in the policy timeline and has no bearing on later processes like reinstatement after lapsation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="28d91714-766b-42cd-8559-cf76b7c97afa">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to review and cancel the policy upon receipt, whereas the incontestability period begins later and limits the insurer's ability to dispute claims after two years. They serve complementary roles without direct causal dependence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="40c847da-d90f-459a-9872-60f7ef19fd1f">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period gives the policyholder time to review and reject the policy, independent of the later incontestability period when the insurer may challenge coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="6fd46389-338e-4186-b747-65809a50a1ba">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period gives the policyholder a chance to void the policy before it becomes binding; however, once the period ends, the insurer gains the legal basis to enforce its rights—including contesting coverage based on prior misrepresentations made during application.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="726d6a54-75c6-4811-9e47-b9b938256a64">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day Right to Examine enables the policyholder to evaluate the contents of the Entire Contract—comprising the policy, application, and attachments—for potential dissatisfaction or errors prior to acceptance.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="62b8f75b-d774-450e-ab8b-266f127aef37">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a 20-day examination period depends on the policy’s immutability; if changes were allowed post-receipt, the right to examine would lose meaning due to potential alterations after acceptance.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="e30bcb57-7999-45fd-95ab-1d5af8b3642a">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period gives the policyholder the right to void the policy if they disagree with its terms, including clauses about waivers or alterations needing written consent.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="2916fbaf-1ddb-4b5c-b5a0-43f4f0d1cbbc">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period provides a safeguard enabling the policyholder to assess whether the policy accurately reflects the application statements used to issue it.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLING_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="b2604be3-8c9d-411a-9752-e7c408e44f8a">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period starts upon receipt of the policy, independent of whether the first premium has been paid, though both are part of early-stage policy activation procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="5ed00eb3-5246-49ea-b4ac-9973d604854e">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination right allows cancellation shortly after receipt, independent of later premium payment requirements that apply once coverage has been accepted.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="b8a0acec-5bad-4385-aa38-b690f03f26b5">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to assess the policy’s terms before it takes effect; once this period expires, the policy becomes active on the scheduled effective date.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="d58b7734-e9a8-4ee8-84f1-1c5d18ebf4e8">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder time to review the policy after receipt, ensuring informed consent before coverage formally begins at 12:01 A.M. on the Effective Date.</data>
  <data key="d4">POSTCEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="5a5e7682-7da5-4049-b77a-16dfdd50aec3">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination right enables the Policy Owner to review and potentially cancel the policy, reinforcing their exclusive control over its terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to evaluate and possibly void the policy early; once expired, the owner gains full rights including changing beneficiaries. This sequence reflects a procedural timeline but does not imply causal or conditional dependence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period exists specifically to allow the policyholder to review the policy and exercise the right to cancel if desired.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to evaluate and potentially void the policy shortly after receiving it. This temporary right does not affect the long-term ability of the owner to assign the policy once the examination period ends.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period exists specifically to enable the Owner to review and evaluate the policy’s terms after receiving it.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES_EXAMINATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="c500b2bb-cfaf-41ad-a305-33298ee4a81b">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period begins upon receipt of the policy and allows cancellation regardless of whether an Owner has been designated; however, if no Owner is named, the Insured becomes the Owner by default.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="80518b2d-1bb2-4fa2-93b9-79573d720a98">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period ensures that the policyowner—identified here as Jordan Everett Hughes—has the opportunity to review and reject the policy before final commitment, reinforcing the importance of clear ownership designation at inception.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO_OWNER</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="90ec6e29-a29c-4e3c-8d1b-c21dc571dc89">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day Right to Examine allows the policyholder to review and potentially cancel the policy before commitment, which could affect whether Elaine M. Hughes ultimately becomes the beneficiary, depending on timing of cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_DEPENDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="d13623e0-a45f-4060-82e1-dbdfcb46c827">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day right to examine allows the policyholder time to review and potentially cancel the policy after receipt, which may influence whether the designated contingent beneficiary remains relevant depending on cancellation timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="af0642b0-b73b-4d5a-941d-8b8a65fef5d4">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day right to examine enables the insured to assess whether the policy's terms, including its level premium structure, meet expectations prior to final commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="dc7d257a-6a88-40ef-9995-0d6cef3ac4dd">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day right to examine provides a window for reviewing coverage before committing fully, which supports the long-term assurance of stable premiums described in fact_sentence_1 by allowing informed decision-making prior to binding agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENHANCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="b12e9b16-bbb5-4f46-b60c-3a7549f861c6">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination right depends on the individual having ownership status; when no owner is named, the insured becomes the owner and thereby gains eligibility for the examination period.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="b2835f9b-be1f-42a0-910e-c6e995ace28d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the duration of the examination window; fact_sentence_2 identifies the party entitled to exercise it—specifically, the Owner—making the second statement a specific application of the first.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="69580977-8680-4303-b27e-16864466b8e8">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 defines the timeframe for examining the policy, which enables the action described in fact_sentence_2—the return of the policy for a full refund. Without the 20-day window, the refund provision would not apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="65938361-ed69-4ef2-88b7-4494b82bd742">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination right allows the policyholder to cancel without penalty, and returning the policy under this provision results in the policy being voided retroactively from its start date.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="12ebf888-5542-48cf-a3ae-6bbbc3b648b6">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to return the policy, resulting in it being treated as if never issued—effectively voiding the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="cd70f299-b66e-49aa-b3c6-69fcc2129242">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period allows the policyholder to assess the policy’s terms and request cancellation, but any modifications to those terms—including extensions or adjustments—are only valid if formally documented in writing, ensuring consistency between initial evaluation and subsequent changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="3319e60e-025b-4b9a-bb2f-a275aa449bb0" target="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day examination period enables the policyholder to reject the policy without penalty; however, once accepted, any future changes require explicit written authorization from the insurer, ensuring controlled amendments post-examination.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
