<edge source="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c" target="0f33598c-4574-441a-b5be-585f58bbce16">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 2's perspective, chunk 1 serves as a concrete example illustrating how generic policy provisions—including beneficiaries, riders, and expiration—are applied in practice.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c" target="4ac4d845-23a9-4953-a088-29b4a743018c">
  <data key="d3">Chunk 1 provides the structural context—including key roles, effective date rules, and ownership rights—which enables the detailed legal safeguards described in chunk 2, such as incontestability and suicide clauses, to be meaningfully interpreted within the broader policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT_FOR</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c" target="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b">
  <data key="d3">Chunk 2 expands on the grace period and reinstatement clauses mentioned in chunk 1 by specifying timing, payment modes, and documentation required, reinforcing the policyholder’s responsibilities and recovery options.</data>
  <data key="d4">ELABORATES_ON</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c" target="19a494bc-d5f5-44ed-9bcf-0eac2596edba">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 enhances the policy by offering a valuable exception to standard death benefit rules, allowing partial payouts during terminal illness without invalidating the contract, thus expanding protection beyond basic guarantees.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXTENDS_PROTECTION</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="324c5044-39d6-4b2d-8c5f-04ae005f768c" target="f53ddb06-6d23-4783-8380-5a098eb98924">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 represents a breach of the very protections it establishes—specifically, unauthorized actions by an official that undermine policy integrity and consumer trust despite clear requirements for written authorization and ethical conduct.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTRASTS_WITH</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
