<edge source="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681" target="a8b806b3-5c59-4a05-a6ee-47c4708daa3c">
  <data key="d3">The first fact concerns early cancellation rights due to dissatisfaction, while the second addresses consequences of late premium payment leading to loss of coverage. These events occur at different stages of policy lifecycle and do not logically influence each other.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
