<edge source="69580977-8680-4303-b27e-16864466b8e8" target="61f37a31-547e-4c2f-8bb7-5fcbc201a22f">
  <data key="d3">The 20-day refund provision offers early exit flexibility before policy activation, while the 31-day grace period supports recovery after a missed payment. Though related through timing and policy safeguards, they govern separate phases of policy lifecycle.</data>
