  <data key="d3">The requirement for written amendments ensures that long-term policy protections like incontestability cannot be modified informally. This safeguards the enforceability of the two-year incontestability rule established in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
