<edge source="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d" target="b12e9b16-bbb5-4f46-b60c-3a7549f861c6">
  <data key="d3">Policy amendments require written consent from an authorized representative, reinforcing governance integrity. This requirement applies regardless of who holds ownership, meaning it operates independently of whether the insured is automatically considered the owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
