  <data key="d3">Any alteration to the policy terms requires written consent from an authorized company officer, regardless of whether the owner previously exercised their 20-day inspection window.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d" target="d31837ea-1599-48d9-acef-f6708a189681">
  <data key="d3">Any modification to the policy terms requires written consent from an authorized officer. This includes potential adjustments related to cancellations or refunds, meaning such actions cannot occur unilaterally—even during the 20-day review window.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO DIRECT RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d" target="69580977-8680-4303-b27e-16864466b8e8">
  <data key="d3">Formal written consent from an authorized officer ensures that rules like the 20-day refund window remain enforceable and unaltered without proper documentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
