  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes that only an authorized officer can legally change the policy, reinforcing the restriction stated in fact_sentence_2 that agents or brokers have no power to modify it.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d" target="9f637f68-638b-4eec-9c72-453a879fc0d8">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 establishes that only an authorized company officer can legally alter policy terms. Fact sentence 2 reinforces this by clarifying that even agents or brokers lack the power to waive provisions, thereby supporting the exclusivity defined in sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">REINFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
