<edge source="2b144ac4-5731-4e59-b5d4-9c1044113d9e" target="b12e9b16-bbb5-4f46-b60c-3a7549f861c6">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability provision, effective after two years, reinforces long-term policy integrity, making it less dependent on initial ownership designations once the waiting period passes.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
