  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 outlines that if the insured dies by suicide within two years, only the premiums paid are refunded. This condition operates regardless of whether the policy was canceled during the 20-day examination window.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
