  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 outlines a limitation on death benefits due to suicide within two years, independent of demographic inaccuracies. Fact sentence 2 explains how coverage adjusts when the insured's age was incorrectly reported, ensuring fairness based on actual risk.</data>
