  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 outlines that suicide within two years results in only a refund of premiums, regardless of the policyholder’s intent. This restriction operates separately from the 20-day cooling-off period described in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
