  <data key="d3">The first sentence discusses adjusting coverage when the insured's age was incorrectly stated, while the second explains termination of benefits if a premium isn't paid by the end of the grace period. These are independent conditions governing different aspects of policy enforcement.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
