  <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period allows time to pay overdue premiums before the policy lapses, enabling future reinstatement by covering those delinquent amounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c4bbdfe5-b5f2-4f13-b7cd-d0bf51cdb854" target="3aea6d6e-6546-4579-b452-cbd38accf2bf">
  <data key="d3">The 31-day grace period provides time to pay premiums before lapsing; if that fails, reinstatement requires proof of insurability, linking the two clauses temporally and conditionally.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
