  <data key="d3">Even though the policy remains in force during the grace period, that status does not override the suicide clause's restriction on claims made within two years of the effective date.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
