  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that unpaid premiums reduce the death benefit if the insured passes during the grace period. This does not depend on whether the owner canceled the policy earlier. The first sentence involves termination prior to commitment, unrelated to claim settlement mechanics.</data>
