  <data key="d3">The second sentence outlines that unpaid premiums are deducted from the death benefit if the insured dies during the grace period. This does not interact directly with the suicide clause described in the first sentence, which applies only to deaths caused by suicide within two years.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
