  <data key="d3">Failure to pay a premium by the end of the grace period results in policy lapse, regardless of whether the owner exercised their 20-day examination right. The examination window does not extend or alter grace period rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
