  <data key="d3">Failure to pay a premium by the end of the grace period causes the policy to lapse, meaning it no longer provides coverage—even if the insured died earlier during the grace period, the claim would only apply if the policy was still in force at time of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
