  <data key="d3">Failure to pay within the grace period terminates coverage; however, reinstatement remains possible within five years provided the applicant proves insurability to the company’s satisfaction.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a8b806b3-5c59-4a05-a6ee-47c4708daa3c" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">The termination of coverage due to unpaid premiums creates the condition under which reinstatement becomes necessary; without lapse, there would be no need for reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a8b806b3-5c59-4a05-a6ee-47c4708daa3c" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">The termination of coverage due to unpaid premiums within the grace period creates the circumstance allowing for potential policy reinstatement up to five years later, provided requirements like proof of insurability and payment of arrears are met.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a8b806b3-5c59-4a05-a6ee-47c4708daa3c" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains that unpaid premiums beyond the grace period result in termination of coverage, which aligns directly with fact_sentence_2 stating that such failure causes the policy to lapse. Both describe the same consequence of missed payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a8b806b3-5c59-4a05-a6ee-47c4708daa3c" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">If a premium is unpaid beyond the grace period, coverage terminates, meaning the policy would no longer be 'in force' at the time of death, thereby preventing the payment of the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a8b806b3-5c59-4a05-a6ee-47c4708daa3c" target="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5">
  <data key="d3">The timely payment of premiums ensures continued coverage, which enables the beneficiary to submit required proof of death and claim the death benefit under the terms outlined in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
