  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy involves paying all past-due premiums, ensuring financial obligations are met before coverage resumes. This requirement operates independently of the incontestability rule, which governs when claims become legally protected.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
