  <data key="d3">Paying past-due premiums enables reinstatement of a lapsed policy, even if prior misrepresentations might have affected its original validity, though those issues remain relevant during review.</data>
  <data key="d4">NECESSARY_CONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
