  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy requires payment of all delinquent premiums, regardless of whether the cause of death would have triggered a suicide clause exclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="330543a9-5d64-4d96-89b1-f5991ca096b7" target="64edfdb5-aded-401b-bbe7-55880fad2b56">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy requires payment of all delinquent premiums, regardless of whether the cause of death was related to suicide during the initial two-year period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
