<edge source="330543a9-5d64-4d96-89b1-f5991ca096b7" target="fffa6d30-0053-4c00-b207-2a77ad194bd2">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy requires paying back missed premiums, whereas the first statement limits insurer obligations in case of suicide during the initial two-year period. These rules apply to different scenarios and do not influence each other directly.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
