  <data key="d3">Chunk 1 sets the legal foundation for the financial mechanisms described in chunk 2, especially concerning late payments, reinstatement timelines, and claim validity tied to policy status.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROVIDES_DETAIL</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b" target="0f33598c-4574-441a-b5be-585f58bbce16">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 supplies concrete contextual information—including the insured person, beneficiaries, riders, and expiration date—that grounds the general policy provisions discussed in chunk 2 in a specific case.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b" target="4ac4d845-23a9-4953-a088-29b4a743018c">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 provides essential context—including policy definition, ownership rights, and the examination period—which enables understanding of why certain features like reinstatement eligibility and claim validity exist.</data>
  <data key="d4">PROVIDES_CONTEXT</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b" target="a73333b0-cb47-4f72-afb6-af150efe48a5">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 extends its logic by introducing mechanisms for managing beneficiary designations and accessing enhanced benefits like accelerated payouts, which depend on the policy remaining active—a condition governed by the payment terms described earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">ELABORATES_ON</data>
  <data key="d5">0.87</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b" target="19a494bc-d5f5-44ed-9bcf-0eac2596edba">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 1’s perspective, chunk 2 provides a mechanism to access part of the death benefit earlier under exceptional circumstances, modifying the standard payout condition without invalidating the original agreement.</data>
  <data key="d4">ELABORATES_ON</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ae44a78d-98ba-4a82-92fb-b9378124227b" target="f53ddb06-6d23-4783-8380-5a098eb98924">
  <data key="d3">Chunk 2 introduces a serious deviation from the norm described in chunk 1, suggesting that even institutions operating under standard policies may harbor internal corruption, undermining trust in the system outlined in chunk 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTRASTS_WITH</data>
