  <data key="d3">Reinstating a lapsed policy does not affect the obligation to pay the death benefit when the insured dies while covered. The ability to reinstate relates to maintaining coverage, whereas the death benefit payment depends solely on timely claims processing once coverage was active at time of death.</data>
