  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that unpaid premiums with interest must be settled to reinstate the policy. This financial requirement follows from the initial necessity of demonstrating insurability.</data>
  <data key="d4">FOLLOWS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83" target="afe75990-53e6-4092-8595-3ddaed9d18bc">
  <data key="d3">Reinstating the policy necessitates paying overdue premiums along with interest, where the interest rate or calculation method is decided by the insurer upon reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
