  <data key="d3">The ability to pay premiums monthly supports the 20-year guarantee mentioned in fact_sentence_1, ensuring predictable and manageable payments throughout the policy’s term.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
