  <data key="d3">Monthly premium payments ensure continuous coverage, which is essential for satisfying the contractual obligations required before the death benefit can be disbursed per the policy’s terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
