  <data key="d3">The option to pay premiums semi-annually pertains to payment scheduling, while the need for additional documentation relates to procedural requirements, possibly for verification or compliance. These elements operate independently within the broader policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
