  <data key="d3">The absence of an automatic premium loan feature relates to financing options for premium payments, whereas the document requirement pertains to verification processes after claims. The two do not influence each other logically.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
