  <data key="d3">The absence of an automatic premium loan feature means the policyholder cannot use borrowed funds to cover missed premiums without additional riders. This has no bearing on whether interest accumulates on the death benefit after the insured’s passing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
