<edge source="2d6cd2a6-4a3a-44fe-aa4e-912059d4a996" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">The policy does not have an automatic premium loan feature, meaning borrowers cannot use it to cover missed payments without adding a rider. Interest being legally required applies generally but has no direct operational link to the absence of the loan provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2d6cd2a6-4a3a-44fe-aa4e-912059d4a996" target="adfc5e3f-7b76-4e27-9e64-1e3c4108cc29">
  <data key="d3">The lack of an automatic premium loan feature relates to how premiums are handled but has no bearing on identifying the designated beneficiary. The information about the beneficiary is independent of any policy benefits or financial provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
