  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains how optional riders enable certain benefits like automatic premium loans. Fact_sentence_2 describes the insurer’s obligation to disburse the death benefit quickly once proper documentation is submitted. The two sentences cover distinct procedural elements without overlapping logic.</data>
