  <data key="d3">An automatic premium loan prevents policy lapse by covering missed payments, reducing the need to reinstate the policy later. Therefore, it indirectly lessens reliance on meeting insurability requirements post-lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">REDUCES_NEED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
