  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="2fe7c477-3ff3-4964-8334-5bce147c512e">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit being paid requires that the policy was actively maintained throughout the insured’s life, including adherence to approved premium payment schedules. Therefore, the successful receipt of the death benefit depends on prior decisions like selecting and honoring a valid payment mode.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDENT_ON</data>
