  <data key="d3">The death benefit is only available if the policy was kept in force, which depends on paying premiums—including the first one due on the effective date—as stipulated in the terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="d0a3204c-79af-4db3-91c3-0206bb2cd580">
  <data key="d3">This statement specifies that the death benefit is transferred to the named beneficiary upon the insured’s death. It does not address the ongoing requirement to pay premiums at regular intervals.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
