  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">The payment of the death benefit depends on the policy being active at the time of death. If the policy has lapsed due to missed payments beyond the grace period, the death benefit would not apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is paid only when the insured passes away during active coverage. Coverage does not terminate with value if the policy lapses due to nonpayment.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="2355dc3f-af2e-4eda-b96d-fd3204fa6b8e">
  <data key="d3">The death benefit is only paid if the policy remains active at the time of death; hence, failure to maintain coverage (as outlined in the reinstatement clause) prevents any payout, effectively terminating benefits without value.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
