  <data key="d3">The death benefit is distributed to the individual or organization legally identified as the beneficiary through official documentation maintained by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">The statement about the death benefit being paid to the beneficiary does not relate to the legal requirement for interest. No connection exists between the disbursement of benefits and statutory interest obligations.</data>
