<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="ad1cb066-961b-4cae-bf88-48a316e04583">
  <data key="d3">The promise of paying the death benefit to the beneficiary depends on sustained premium payments, including those made via the monthly bank draft system outlined in the first fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="a337b41c-27fd-4c74-8c49-2a45657cee74">
  <data key="d3">The payment of the death benefit to the beneficiary depends on the policy being active at the time of death, which requires maintaining premiums over the 20-year guaranteed period as outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="cdb0fe5e-2332-46bf-8e3c-ce3e60450bd4">
  <data key="d3">If the policyholder dies while the policy is inactive due to non-payment, the death benefit cannot be claimed; however, reinstating within 5 years restores eligibility for the benefit payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="8553795c-a210-458d-bbd9-47de9966423a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 affirms the outcome described in fact_sentence_1—the payment of the Death Benefit to the beneficiary—providing confirmation that the promised action takes place when triggered.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONFIRMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556" target="3c328b68-a332-4773-9c29-f646235f7d51">
  <data key="d3">The designation of the beneficiary in fact_sentence_2 provides the recipient context for the conditional obligation detailed in fact_sentence_1, where the insurer’s duty to pay hinges on adherence to policy terms before release of funds.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
