<edge source="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">Whether the death benefit is paid in a lump sum has no bearing on whether a lapsed policy can be reinstated. Reinstatement depends on underwriting and payment of arrears, unrelated to settlement options.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff" target="3aea6d6e-6546-4579-b452-cbd38accf2bf">
  <data key="d3">Whether the death benefit is paid in a lump sum does not affect the requirement to prove insurability when reinstating a lapsed policy; they relate to separate events in the policy timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
