  <data key="d3">Approval from the company is needed for any non-standard death benefit payouts, regardless of whether prior reinstatement actions were taken. Reinstatement eligibility depends solely on financial repayment and underwriting, not on settlement method approvals.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
