<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594">
  <data key="d3">Approval from the company is required before altering how benefits are settled upon death, just as it is needed when modifying the premium payment mode. These rules highlight standardized oversight across distinct aspects of policy administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRES_APPROVAL</data>
