<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for company approval of alternative settlement options becomes relevant only after a policy has lapsed, meaning the need arises from the termination of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITION_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
