</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="2355dc3f-af2e-4eda-b96d-fd3204fa6b8e">
  <data key="d3">The need for company approval of alternative settlements implies that certain payout arrangements depend on maintaining active status, reinforcing why non-reinstated policies lose value entirely.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
