  <data key="d3">Approval by the company for an alternative settlement option implies that such options exist under the policy but are conditional upon meeting defined criteria, thereby reflecting constraints tied to the broader death benefit provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff">
  <data key="d3">Approval by the company is required before any non-lump-sum settlement option can take effect, thereby directly influencing how the death benefit is distributed per the initial terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
