  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 requires company approval for alternative settlements, and fact_sentence_2 explains that the company may impose further documentation demands as part of its evaluation process.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">Alternative settlement options require prior approval from the Company before implementation, but the timing of death benefit disbursement depends solely on timely submission of acceptable proof of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_DEPENDENCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 discusses administrative control over settlement choices, requiring company approval. Fact sentence 2 states that interest application is mandated by law, independent of settlement decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for company approval of alternative settlement options does not affect the calculation or timing of interest accumulation on the death benefit. Interest accrual occurs automatically per policy terms regardless of settlement choice.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">The statement about requiring company approval for alternative settlement options does not relate to defining the beneficiary’s identity. The beneficiary designation is independent of how benefits are settled after death.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc" target="adfc5e3f-7b76-4e27-9e64-1e3c4108cc29">
  <data key="d3">Alternative settlement options require company approval, which depends on having a legally recognized beneficiary. The beneficiary’s identity, established through official documentation, determines eligibility for receiving benefits under any settlement method.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
