  <data key="d3">Providing proof of death is necessary for claiming benefits and occurs independently of prior decisions about premium payment modes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5" target="f501fcfb-9924-4880-8895-de800216cc6b">
  <data key="d3">Providing proof of death is necessary only after the insured has passed away, regardless of whether the first premium was timely paid. The obligation to submit proof is unrelated to the timing of the initial premium payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
