  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 outlines the requirement for submitting a certified death certificate as proof of death. Fact sentence 1 notes the absence of an automatic premium loan option. The presence or absence of this loan feature has no bearing on what documents are needed after the insured’s passing.</data>
