  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">A certified death certificate serves as essential documentation that satisfies the requirement for proving death, enabling the insurer to process the claim.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61" target="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes a baseline requirement for proof of death. Fact_sentence_2 expands on this by allowing the insurer to request supplementary documents beyond the minimum standard.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXTENDS</data>
