  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="c820716a-1bb8-4038-8551-7d16255552ef">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="6fbca99c-d82a-419a-a65e-2f7a13f2e5a8">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="e2e0d251-6a32-431c-8916-25b50b9da57c">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">DATE</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="497b5830-6fda-41aa-9d45-c4a8ccfb430a">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="9c89e85e-1492-4c22-95b2-335f38e5e736">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="79f3d899-e4f3-4b8c-8d8b-81deccf3ba56">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="aea995b1-8b42-44f6-a013-dcfd1c79a576">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="7a489553-bc1f-4423-8df5-89798c722cb2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">DOCUMENT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation from the company arises when processing actions like policy reinstatement after lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="3aea6d6e-6546-4579-b452-cbd38accf2bf">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation arises from the requirement to demonstrate insurability when reinstating a lapsed policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation could arise when fulfilling reinstatement terms, including repayment of overdue premiums with interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="afe75990-53e6-4092-8595-3ddaed9d18bc">
  <data key="d3">Providing additional documentation enables the insurer to verify eligibility and accurately determine the amount of interest owed on past-due premiums during reinstatement.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="65a43e84-d268-46ce-900c-06f4538f2516">
  <data key="d3">Requests for additional documentation could arise from discrepancies or incomplete data related to the premium amounts and modes listed in the Schedule of Benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="d3aeb4da-98f5-49aa-9680-88328bc6317d">
  <data key="d3">While additional documentation may be needed at various stages, including possibly around claim filing, it does not logically stem from or affect the rule that premiums must be paid in advance.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="a81e586d-f4c9-49fe-827d-4bb85cdc14e2">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation arises possibly during claims settlement, independent of how frequently premiums are paid. Monthly payments do not inherently trigger further paperwork beyond standard procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="06c6864a-8a1b-46ee-bb2f-99522c008d8a">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation could arise independently from any payment method selected, including quarterly premiums. There is no indication that choosing quarterly payments triggers or necessitates extra paperwork.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="ae290ac1-57d5-418a-aeff-3020cd16c2e5">
  <data key="d3">Requiring additional documentation could apply at various stages, including claim processing or reinstatement, but it does not directly depend on choosing a semi-annual payment frequency. There is no inherent logical dependence between the two statements.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="fc47d11a-7ce2-4140-9e5d-84adfba6efd3">
  <data key="d3">While additional documentation may be requested by the company at various points, its need is independent of whether premiums are paid annually or through another frequency.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="67535076-c012-4f51-9fca-3da547334acf">
  <data key="d3">While additional documentation may be requested, its requirement is independent of the policy owner’s selection of a premium payment mode.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="2fe7c477-3ff3-4964-8334-5bce147c512e">
  <data key="d3">If additional documentation is required, it typically follows after the company has approved the selected premium payment mode, ensuring proper validation before processing payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES_WITH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="f501fcfb-9924-4880-8895-de800216cc6b">
  <data key="d3">While the first premium’s due date marks the start of financial obligations, any request for additional documentation typically arises from underwriting or verification needs unrelated to the exact timing of payments, making its relation to the first premium due date tenuous.</data>
  <data key="d4">DOCUMENTATION_NEEDED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="d0a3204c-79af-4db3-91c3-0206bb2cd580">
  <data key="d3">The possibility of requiring extra documents from the company does not affect when premiums are due or how they should be paid. The need for documentation is independent of the established payment schedule described in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="a88904d4-aa6d-4deb-9bf5-50550bbc075d">
  <data key="d3">If additional documentation is required, it may be due to a requested change in premium payment frequency by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESPONSE_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation arises when the policy owner initiates a change in premium payment method, ensuring proper authorization and recordkeeping.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594">
  <data key="d3">After providing written notice to change the premium mode, the company may demand additional documentation to validate the requested adjustment.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="c8766159-f2f1-4980-a4f4-30a5ac151e22">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation arises when requesting changes to the premium mode, particularly before the company grants approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRELIMINARY_TO_APPROVAL</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">Requiring additional documentation could occur after a policy lapses due to missed payments, especially when seeking reinstatement or claiming benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">While additional documentation might be requested under certain circumstances, its requirement is independent of whether coverage has terminated without value at lapse.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="2355dc3f-af2e-4eda-b96d-fd3204fa6b8e">
  <data key="d3">Requesting additional documentation from the insurer does not influence or result from the rule that coverage lapses without value outside reinstatement terms. They address separate aspects of policy administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="2d6cd2a6-4a3a-44fe-aa4e-912059d4a996">
  <data key="d3">Requirement for additional documentation concerns procedural compliance, independent of whether a premium loan feature exists. No dependency exists between document needs and the presence or absence of a loan option.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="cf255e83-6bf3-43a7-a0f5-ffa85d8f1f6d">
  <data key="d3">While additional documentation might be needed for various policy changes, including riders like the Automatic Premium Loan, its necessity isn't explicitly tied to that particular change without further context.</data>
  <data key="d4">NOT_RELEVANT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b">
  <data key="d3">Although additional documentation may be requested by the company, this does not directly influence or depend on whether an automatic premium loan is used to cover missed payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="0e6c34e9-34ee-4684-a4db-b8f932cd319e">
  <data key="d3">While additional documentation may be requested by the company, it does not inherently affect whether a policy loan covers unpaid premiums, nor vice versa.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">While fact_sentence_1 outlines the core trigger for payout—the verified death of the insured—fact_sentence_2 adds context that extra evidence could be necessary to fulfill the requirement stated in the prior sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556">
  <data key="d3">Submission of additional documentation is necessary to fulfill the requirement for releasing the death benefit to the beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5">
  <data key="d3">Required documentation ensures adherence to policy terms governing the disbursement of the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES_TERM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff">
  <data key="d3">If additional documentation is requested by the company, it may pertain to verifying eligibility for a non-lump-sum death benefit settlement option.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc">
  <data key="d3">The need for additional documentation arises because the company requires thorough review prior to approving any deviation from standard payout procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRELIMINARY_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5">
  <data key="d3">While only minimal proof is initially mandated, insurers may demand supplementary evidence to support the claim, building upon the foundational requirement.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXTENDS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">While a certified death certificate is essential, companies retain authority to request extra documentation to support claim processing.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 introduces the possibility of needing extra documents; fact_sentence_2 specifies that such requirements stem from the Company’s reasonable discretion, providing justification for the initial statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">If further documentation is needed, it must be submitted before the company proceeds with paying the death benefit, ensuring compliance with verification requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONS PAYMENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for additional documentation by the company does not relate to the legal obligation for interest payments. These are independent procedural and regulatory aspects.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for additional documentation ensures accurate claim assessment, which precedes any calculation or disbursement involving accrued interest on the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for additional documentation by the company may involve verifying the identity or legitimacy of the beneficiary named in the application.</data>
  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d" target="adfc5e3f-7b76-4e27-9e64-1e3c4108cc29">
  <data key="d3">Additional documentation might be needed to verify claims or updates related to the beneficiary’s status. However, the definition of the Beneficiary relies solely on the latest written designation on record, independent of document requests.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.25</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8d13f3e7-975b-4ab4-8482-cb217fb8bd67" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">requires_additional_documentation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9c89e85e-1492-4c22-95b2-335f38e5e736" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">may require</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7a489553-bc1f-4423-8df5-89798c722cb2" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
