  <data key="d3">Receiving proof of death triggers the payout of the death benefit, independent of any prior interest charges on overdue premiums that may apply during reinstatement. There is no mutual dependency between these processes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
