  <data key="d3">The timely disbursement of the death benefit hinges on submitting proper documentation and occurs regardless of whether premium loans were available. The presence or absence of a premium loan feature has no bearing on claims processing speed.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
