  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 outlines the timely disbursement of the death benefit upon verified death. Fact_sentence_1 details a mechanism to prevent lapses by using a policy loan for unpaid premiums. While both relate to policy outcomes, one focuses on maintaining coverage and the other on claiming benefits afterward, without mutual dependency.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
