  <data key="d3">The accrual of interest on the death benefit is independent of whether the policy was ever reinstated after lapsing. Reinstatement eligibility depends on time since lapse and insurability, not on death benefit interest calculations.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
