  <data key="d3">The second sentence explains that interest accumulates on the death benefit from the date of death onward, whereas the first sentence outlines premium amounts and payment schedules. These statements address separate phases of the insurance contract without mutual dependence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
