  <data key="d3">The second statement involves interest accruing after death, unrelated to when premiums are paid. The first focuses solely on advance payment schedules without reference to payout terms or interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
