  <data key="d3">The second statement explains that interest begins accruing on the death benefit from the date of death onward. This does not relate to the method or timing of premium payments described in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
