  <data key="d3">Accrual of interest on the death benefit occurs regardless of the approved premium payment mode, making it independent of that decision.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="f501fcfb-9924-4880-8895-de800216cc6b">
  <data key="d3">Accrual of interest on the death benefit occurs independently after the insured’s death and has no bearing on the timing of the first premium payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="d0a3204c-79af-4db3-91c3-0206bb2cd580">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that interest starts accumulating on the death benefit from the moment of death onward. The first sentence details the recurring deadlines for paying premiums under various modes, unrelated to death benefit calculations.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
