  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">Accrual of interest on the death benefit occurs only after the insured’s death and is unrelated to whether premiums were timely paid prior to that event.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit begins at the time of death regardless of whether the policy had lapsed prior. Policy lapse status has no bearing on the start or duration of interest accumulation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="2355dc3f-af2e-4eda-b96d-fd3204fa6b8e">
  <data key="d3">The second statement explains that interest begins accruing upon death, regardless of whether the policy was terminated earlier. The first statement does not affect this calculation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="2d6cd2a6-4a3a-44fe-aa4e-912059d4a996">
  <data key="d3">Interest begins accruing on the death benefit from the date of death until it is paid out, regardless of whether the policy includes an automatic premium loan option. The presence or absence of such a loan feature does not affect how interest is calculated on the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="cf255e83-6bf3-43a7-a0f5-ffa85d8f1f6d">
  <data key="d3">Interest accumulation on the death benefit has no bearing on whether an Automatic Premium Loan provision can be added via rider. They address distinct policy provisions without mutual influence.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b">
  <data key="d3">Interest on the death benefit begins at the time of death regardless of whether an automatic premium loan was used to maintain coverage, meaning the loan mechanism has no bearing on the calculation of accrued interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="0e6c34e9-34ee-4684-a4db-b8f932cd319e">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit has no bearing on whether a policy loan can be used to settle unpaid premiums. Each mechanism operates under distinct conditions unrelated to the other.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">The calculation of interest beginning at the time of death assumes the prior condition—that the death has been verified and the policy remains in force—which enables the claim settlement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit implies that the amount paid to the beneficiary exceeds the base death benefit, making timely processing essential post-death.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5">
  <data key="d3">If interest accrues on the Death Benefit from the date of death onward, it implies the benefit is recognized and payable under the policy’s rules, reinforcing that its disbursement is conditional upon meeting stated terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">IMPLIES_TERM</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff">
  <data key="d3">Since interest accrues from the date of death until payment, it implies the death benefit is disbursed as a lump sum unless otherwise arranged.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit from the date of death onward applies uniformly across all settlement methods, including those requiring prior company approval, but it does not influence whether such approvals are granted.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit starts at the time of death, but only applies once official proof of death has been accepted by the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest begins at the time of death only after official proof like a certified death certificate has been submitted and verified, ensuring that payments reflect correct timelines tied to documented events.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the death benefit begins at the time of death and continues until payout, influencing the final amount disbursed after documentation has been verified.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4">
  <data key="d3">Accrual of interest on the death benefit begins at the time of death regardless of whether supporting documents have been submitted; it is independent of documentation demands.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">Interest begins accruing from the date of death onward; its calculation depends on when the death benefit is actually paid, which happens only after proper documentation is submitted.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e">
  <data key="d3">The accumulation of interest on the death benefit post-death is justified by statutory requirements mandating interest payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">JUSTIFIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">Interest accrual begins upon the insured’s death and continues until payment, but only applies once the rightful beneficiary has been identified and verified.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECONDITION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439" target="adfc5e3f-7b76-4e27-9e64-1e3c4108cc29">
  <data key="d3">Interest begins accruing on the death benefit from the moment of death, but only applies once it has been determined who is eligible to receive the funds. The identity of the rightful beneficiary depends on the latest official designation filed with the insurer.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
