  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="0d0fd75b-3f4e-4735-b0c2-d468b6eb33e3">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">DOCUMENT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="fb72e3f0-f7b4-42f1-8874-ebac56171d8b">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest ensures that when a policyholder seeks to reinstate a lapsed policy, they must account for accrued interest, which is part of the reinstatement condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="3aea6d6e-6546-4579-b452-cbd38accf2bf">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws requiring interest on overdue premiums apply regardless of whether insurability has been demonstrated, making them independent requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="e6dc59e3-a8f4-4f56-940d-46199cdc1c83">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest ensures that when reinstating a lapsed policy, insurers collect accrued financial compensation, making it a necessary component of the reinstatement process.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="afe75990-53e6-4092-8595-3ddaed9d18bc">
  <data key="d3">Since interest on unpaid premiums is required by law, the insurance company has the legal right to determine its amount upon reinstatement, ensuring compliance with regulatory standards.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="65a43e84-d268-46ce-900c-06f4538f2516">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws require interest to be applied on unpaid premiums during reinstatement, which depends on prior knowledge of the original premium amount and timing—information found in the Schedule of Benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="d3aeb4da-98f5-49aa-9680-88328bc6317d">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws requiring interest do not inherently depend on whether premiums are paid in advance; rather, they govern repayment terms after delinquency. The advance-payment condition does not logically necessitate legal interest provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_DIRECT_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="a81e586d-f4c9-49fe-827d-4bb85cdc14e2">
  <data key="d3">The requirement for interest under applicable law does not clarify or depend on whether premiums are paid monthly. The legal mandate applies independently of payment timing.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="06c6864a-8a1b-46ee-bb2f-99522c008d8a">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest has no bearing on whether premiums can be paid quarterly. Interest obligations apply independently of payment scheduling choices.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="ae290ac1-57d5-418a-aeff-3020cd16c2e5">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest does not depend on choosing a semi-annual payment plan; it pertains more broadly to late or delinquent payments, regardless of the selected payment frequency.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="fc47d11a-7ce2-4140-9e5d-84adfba6efd3">
  <data key="d3">The legal obligation to charge interest does not affect how often premiums are paid, including annually. Interest applies regardless of payment frequency but is not triggered solely by choosing annual payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="67535076-c012-4f51-9fca-3da547334acf">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws mandate that interest be charged, regardless of the premium payment mode selected by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="2fe7c477-3ff3-4964-8334-5bce147c512e">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws requiring interest do not affect the selection or approval of a premium payment mode; they apply regardless of the chosen method.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="f501fcfb-9924-4880-8895-de800216cc6b">
  <data key="d3">Applicable law requiring interest ensures that any outstanding amounts, including the first premium, accumulate interest over time if not paid promptly.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="d0a3204c-79af-4db3-91c3-0206bb2cd580">
  <data key="d3">While interest may be legally required, its presence doesn't determine when subsequent premiums are due—they follow the agreed-upon payment frequency regardless of statutory interest provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="a88904d4-aa6d-4deb-9bf5-50550bbc075d">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws requiring interest do not influence the ability to change premium payment frequency, but they govern financial consequences when payments are delayed.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELEVANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="c9080843-8376-4174-a9be-27f5cfe85dc2">
  <data key="d3">Legal mandates requiring interest do not influence the ability to switch premium payment methods; those changes remain at the discretion of the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="7dd274eb-79fa-4549-9a30-e662efe45594">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest does not depend on whether a policyholder changes their premium payment mode; it applies independently across all scenarios involving unpaid amounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="c8766159-f2f1-4980-a4f4-30a5ac151e22">
  <data key="d3">Legal mandates requiring interest do not influence or depend on the timing or approval of premium mode changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="18dba2f2-8e4f-4bcc-9c25-79f3830d6409">
  <data key="d3">Legally required interest applies generally, but its relation to the timing or consequences of missed premium payments is unspecified, making direct linkage unclear.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="b160aaee-2bb3-42d4-99f1-e1274612ebc3">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest has no bearing on whether coverage ends without value at lapse. Interest pertains to repayment terms post-lapse, not the condition of termination itself.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="2355dc3f-af2e-4eda-b96d-fd3204fa6b8e">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate for interest payment is unrelated to the condition of coverage termination without value, as it pertains to different aspects of policy administration.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="2d6cd2a6-4a3a-44fe-aa4e-912059d4a996">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws require interest to be charged where permitted, but since the policy lacks an automatic premium loan feature, those interest rules don’t trigger under normal circumstances. Thus, the requirement exists independently of whether the loan option is present.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="cf255e83-6bf3-43a7-a0f5-ffa85d8f1f6d">
  <data key="d3">While interest is mandated by law, its existence does not affect how or whether an Automatic Premium Loan provision can be added to the policy via rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="3ac57c69-3ec6-47e1-9a1c-8e288edc1b2b">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest ensures that any automatic premium loan used to cover delinquent payments incurs cost, reinforcing financial accountability.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="0e6c34e9-34ee-4684-a4db-b8f932cd319e">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest ensures that any outstanding balance from a policy loan used to cover unpaid premiums accumulates cost over time, affecting repayment terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="defb9349-5ec2-419c-99cf-a721b93806df">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence refers to a general legal obligation regarding interest, which may apply in various contexts like unpaid premiums, but has no clear connection to the timing or conditions of death benefit disbursement mentioned in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="401085bd-ec9b-4194-a332-d312acf2f556">
  <data key="d3">The legal requirement for interest applies generally to financial obligations like unpaid premiums but has no bearing on how or when the death benefit is paid to the beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="b9f4573a-344d-4bda-a387-f3c32ffcf8c5">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws requiring interest do not condition or modify how the death benefit is paid under the policy, which depends instead on claim documentation and coverage status.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELEVANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="2030c442-4fb0-495a-995b-bc3c20a392ff">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence notes a legal obligation requiring interest, but this has no bearing on whether the death benefit is paid in a lump sum or through another option. The first sentence focuses solely on settlement choices without mentioning interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="e7ae6851-fbec-41a1-96fb-55af6ecf7ebc">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 highlights a statutory requirement for charging interest, which does not influence or depend on whether a settlement option requires company approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="c8957594-3af6-486f-91f2-abe9eabc42e5">
  <data key="d3">Legal obligations regarding interest payment have no bearing on the necessity of providing proof of death. Each condition stands separately in the policy framework.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="e15e7155-24f9-4078-bb5f-26d32c0baa61">
  <data key="d3">The legal mandate requiring interest has no bearing on what constitutes acceptable proof of death for claim processing.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="38feed0f-4953-4e2f-a66c-0c3a2fbe012d">
  <data key="d3">Legal mandates for interest do not influence or depend on whether the company requests additional documentation from the policyholder.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="5e097a82-f754-43e4-905d-5d147b217df4">
  <data key="d3">Statutory interest requirements do not depend on the type or amount of documentation submitted by the claimant.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="827c6995-f0dd-4669-b3cd-e64364930b24">
  <data key="d3">Applicable laws requiring interest are independent of the insurer’s obligation to disburse the death benefit quickly upon verification of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4">
  <data key="d3">This statement addresses statutory interest obligations but does not relate to the identity or designation of the beneficiary.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aa4414ad-2a6e-42ca-8162-e018fe5fd62e" target="9a0ec08d-cc0c-4623-90af-479513e70439">
  <data key="d3">Legal mandates requiring interest ensure that accrued interest on the death benefit is appropriately compensated upon payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">MANDATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
