  <data key="d3">The identity of the beneficiary has no bearing on whether a lapsed policy can be reinstated, as reinstatement depends solely on time elapsed, insurability, and payment terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
