  <data key="d3">The definition of the beneficiary as the named recipient has no bearing on the available modes of premium payment, including monthly installments. One statement provides administrative details about payments; the other identifies a key party in claim settlement.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="db12acf6-7ef1-442a-a0b0-0ebe2981d3c4" target="06c6864a-8a1b-46ee-bb2f-99522c008d8a">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies the beneficiary as the individual or organization designated in the application. Fact_sentence_1 outlines available premium payment frequencies, including quarterly. No causal or contextual link exists between the roles defined here and payment methods.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
