<edge source="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd" target="4f081890-55f2-4345-893f-c638987334c2">
  <data key="d3">If no surviving beneficiary exists, the death benefit goes to the policy owner only if they are alive; however, this depends on prior beneficiary designations being properly updated, which occurs instantly upon submission per fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd" target="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4">
  <data key="d3">If no surviving beneficiary exists, the death benefit goes to the policy owner only if they are alive; however, any prior beneficiary update remains binding due to its immediate生效 upon filing, ensuring the intended successor is recognized despite the insured’s demise.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
