  <data key="d3">Sentence 1 defines the outcome when no surviving beneficiary exists, specifying the policy owner receives the death benefit if alive. Sentence 2 establishes that any beneficiary update becomes effective at the time of signing, ensuring timely implementation of such decisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
