  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 defines a contingent payment outcome tied to the policy owner’s survival after the insured’s death. This context may inform why the policy owner might need access to policy documents, such as verifying eligibility for the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL_RELATION</data>
