<edge source="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains how beneficiary changes become effective immediately upon receipt, independent of the insured's status. This autonomy supports the policy owner’s authority discussed in fact_sentence_2 regarding assignments, reinforcing overall control over policy disposition.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d3">Changing a beneficiary becomes effective upon submission, independent of the insured's life status. This does not affect the legal validity of an assignment, which remains outside the company's liability.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4" target="89ec8af1-a187-47d1-be96-dd8563e25f71">
  <data key="d3">Changing a beneficiary becomes effective upon receipt by the company, independent of the insured’s life status. This does not relate to the tax responsibilities associated with assigning the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">Change of beneficiary becomes effective upon receipt by the company, even if the insured has passed away. However, such changes remain subject to any existing assignment agreements that might restrict the owner’s authority.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUBJECT TO</data>
