  <data key="d3">Changing a beneficiary becomes effective immediately upon submission, independent of the insured's life status. This action does not affect the timing or validity of policy cancellation, which terminates coverage separately.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
