  <data key="d3">Change of beneficiary procedures are governed by specific timing rules independent of the insured’s life status. The policy owner may also obtain detailed financial information such as premium payment history.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
