<edge source="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">Changing a beneficiary becomes effective immediately after submission, regardless of the insured’s life status. This change does not affect the policy owner’s subsequent choice regarding how the death benefit is settled.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
