<edge source="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s ability to assign the policy involves transferring legal interests. This action has no direct bearing on when or how interest accumulates after the insured’s death.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
