</edge>
<edge source="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c" target="03cfef7f-f2a0-44bd-864f-0344e97bc6d0">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s authority to assign the policy includes transferring legal interest, which might result in new parties assuming rights over the policy—including potential influence on future beneficiary designations—but does not inherently modify how beneficiaries are defined.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
