  <data key="d3">The second sentence states the company disclaims responsibility for assignment validity, meaning it does not assess whether an assignment complies with law. This contrasts with the first sentence, which explains how beneficiaries are officially determined via documented designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
