</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in immediate termination of coverage, but it has no impact on how or when interest accumulates after the insured’s death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="03cfef7f-f2a0-44bd-864f-0344e97bc6d0">
  <data key="d3">Policy cancellation results in termination of coverage but has no bearing on how beneficiaries are designated or identified under the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd">
  <data key="d3">This statement clarifies the consequence of cancelling the policy: coverage ends. This statement specifies the default recipient of the death benefit under specific survivorship conditions involving the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="0c2f9120-31fb-43ab-81cd-fae794c65930">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in immediate termination of coverage, independent of how the death benefit would be distributed under specific survivorship conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in termination of coverage but does not inherently impact the validity or process of changing beneficiaries unless explicitly restricted.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="6903f2e1-fcf8-476e-af64-83ccd3093b64">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation terminates insurance coverage entirely, but this event has no bearing on the effectiveness of previously signed beneficiary changes, which already took effect at the time of signing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="4f081890-55f2-4345-893f-c638987334c2">
  <data key="d3">Policy cancellation results in full termination of coverage, but it has no bearing on the effectiveness of prior or future beneficiary changes, which remain governed by separate rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="4ec4c4a4-c570-4478-be1c-c95a2d28b386">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in loss of coverage, rendering future beneficiary changes irrelevant since the policy no longer exists.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="f0a5245e-9eeb-422b-b2ca-4304e824a7be">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation terminates insurance coverage entirely, but this event has no bearing on the effectiveness of previously signed beneficiary changes, which already took effect at the time of signing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4">
  <data key="d3">Policy cancellation results in full termination of coverage, but it has no bearing on the effectiveness of prior or future beneficiary changes, which remain governed by separate rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in termination of coverage, irrespective of prior assignments made by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation leads to termination of coverage, whereas the prior statement clarifies that the company does not guarantee the validity of assignments. These represent independent policy mechanisms unrelated in sequence or causality.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="89ec8af1-a187-47d1-be96-dd8563e25f71">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence states that cancellation ends insurance coverage, but it does not address financial or tax responsibilities tied to assignments.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in immediate termination of coverage, irrespective of any prior assignments affecting ownership or beneficiary rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">Termination of coverage occurs when the policy owner exercises their right to cancel the policy via a formal written notice.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESULT_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601">
  <data key="d3">When coverage is canceled, it ends immediately, resulting in an end to any future benefit payouts. This termination renders the policy inactive and prevents additional claims or disbursements.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c">
  <data key="d3">When insurance coverage is cancelled, it ends immediately. Any unearned premiums are then eligible for refund according to applicable laws.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation ends coverage but does not affect the policy owner’s existing rights to access historical data such as premium payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation ends insurance coverage but does not affect the policy owner’s existing right to access policy documents, which remains independent of coverage status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation ends coverage entirely, but does not affect the policy owner’s ongoing right to request supplementary benefits like riders or endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation ends insurance coverage but does not affect the policy owner’s pre-existing right to designate beneficiaries, which remains independent of coverage status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in termination of coverage, but does not affect the insurer’s duty to respond to requests for policy-related information within a reasonable period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_EFFECT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation results in termination of coverage, but does not affect the insurer’s duty to comply with legal obligations regarding information provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_DEPENDENCY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation ends active coverage but does not affect the policy owner’s right to designate how the death benefit is settled after the insured’s passing.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation terminates coverage entirely, but does not affect the process of electing or modifying settlement options, which remain governed by separate administrative procedures requiring company approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd" target="911c8355-e674-438d-8970-674b61225d1c">
  <data key="d3">Cancellation ends coverage entirely, but does not affect the applicability of settlement option rules, which remain governed by contractual terms regardless of coverage status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
