<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">The refund of unearned premiums is governed by law and does not relate directly to the policy owner’s authority to request additional riders or endorsements.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458">
  <data key="d3">The refund of unearned premiums is governed by law and does not rely on the timing of information provision. This statement stands independently from the company’s duty to respond to requests.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59">
  <data key="d3">Unearned premium refunds are governed by law, and the insurer must comply by issuing such refunds when due. This aligns with broader statutory duties requiring transparency and lawful handling of policyholder information.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLIES_WITH</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">Unearned premium refunds relate to pre-death financial settlements when a policy ends early, while changing the death benefit payment method occurs after the insured’s passing. The two concepts operate independently in terms of timing and purpose.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="911c8355-e674-438d-8970-674b61225d1c">
  <data key="d3">The refund of unearned premiums is governed by law and does not relate directly to the process of electing or changing settlement options.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c" target="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb">
  <data key="d3">Unearned premium refunds are governed by law and unrelated to settlement option changes. The timing or existence of such refunds does not influence whether an approved request for a new settlement method is processed.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b6f1c45d-b1ab-44fb-ba5a-d5f5adce34f2" target="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">is responsible for refunding</data>
</edge>
