  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">ORGANIZATION</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="aebd5de6-c091-49b6-aced-8567f4b0435a">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">PERSON</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="e5e4a77a-a873-42e4-8d3d-f985913ab9f3">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="ee183286-4de6-4d28-989d-fde325b5d894">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">DOCUMENT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="9adb0d6f-c70d-4c73-b787-505e4564dca2">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="bf5d434b-991a-42a3-b71c-53a12595fb79">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">CONCEPT</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="3780a644-a840-432f-8058-1ce87d6b6030">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">RIDER</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to request a copy of the policy is an independent administrative privilege unrelated to how interest accumulates after death.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="03cfef7f-f2a0-44bd-864f-0344e97bc6d0">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to receive a copy of the policy supports transparency and verification processes, though it is independent of how beneficiaries are designated.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 grants the policy owner the authority to retrieve policy documentation. Such access could support verification of terms related to beneficiary designations and death benefit disbursement, potentially relevant when determining whether the policy owner qualifies under clause 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="0c2f9120-31fb-43ab-81cd-fae794c65930">
  <data key="d3">This statement grants the policy owner the authority to retrieve policy information, independent of death benefit disbursement rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">Requesting a policy copy supports transparency but does not affect the process or outcome of changing a beneficiary designation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="6903f2e1-fcf8-476e-af64-83ccd3093b64">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to access policy documents does not affect when a beneficiary change becomes effective after being signed.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="4f081890-55f2-4345-893f-c638987334c2">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner may request a copy of the policy at any time. This administrative right operates independently of decisions regarding beneficiary changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="f0a5245e-9eeb-422b-b2ca-4304e824a7be">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to access policy documents does not affect when a beneficiary change becomes effective after being signed.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="ea7568f9-97e8-481c-ba9d-673126fb9ca4">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner may request a copy of the policy at any time. This administrative right operates independently of decisions regarding beneficiary changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="4ec4c4a4-c570-4478-be1c-c95a2d28b386">
  <data key="d3">Requesting a policy copy provides documentation needed for informed decisions, such as changing a beneficiary, though it is not required before making such a change.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 grants the Policy Owner access to policy records, which could support informed decisions about assigning the policy—such as verifying terms before submission—as described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to receive a copy of the policy does not affect or imply anything about the company’s responsibility concerning assignment validity.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="89ec8af1-a187-47d1-be96-dd8563e25f71">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to receive a copy of the policy does not affect or imply anything about the company’s stance on tax consequences from assignments.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">The existence of an assignment can restrict the policy owner’s ability to exercise rights such as requesting a copy of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">LIMITED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 grants the policy owner the ability to obtain copies of the policy, supporting transparency. This right operates separately from the power to cancel the policy mentioned in fact sentence 1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd">
  <data key="d3">The right to request a policy copy exists regardless of whether coverage is active or canceled, so it is unaffected by the act of cancellation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601">
  <data key="d3">The right to request a policy copy exists independently of cancellation events, though it may be exercised before or after cancellation without altering its validity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 allows the policy owner to obtain a copy of the policy, supporting transparency but not affecting how unearned premiums are handled. Fact_sentence_1 deals solely with statutory refund obligations tied to unused premium time.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The Policy Owner can obtain a copy of the policy, enabling them to review terms and documentation. This access supports informed decisions when requesting beneficiary designations.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 grants the policy owner access to the full policy document, which would include detailed financial data such as premium payment history described in fact sentence 2.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPLEMENTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to request a copy of the policy, and the company commits to providing the requested documents promptly.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESPONDS_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the right to request a copy of the policy, and the company fulfills this request by supplying the required documents under legal requirements.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPLIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 grants the policy owner access to the core policy document, which naturally includes relevant riders and endorsements. This creates a foundation for requesting supplementary materials like those mentioned in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXTENDS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">The right to obtain a copy of the policy supports transparency and informed decision-making, enabling the Policy Owner to understand available options like selecting settlement methods for the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="911c8355-e674-438d-8970-674b61225d1c">
  <data key="d3">Having the right to obtain a policy copy allows the owner to review available settlement options before making an election, supporting informed decision-making regarding changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to request a copy of the policy provides access to documentation, which may include details about settlement options. However, obtaining such documents does not guarantee automatic approval for changes to those options.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="67ea902a-000e-45d2-99dd-8a832a20afc4">
  <data key="d3">Having the right to request a policy copy facilitates the exercise of other ownership rights, such as updating beneficiaries, enabling proper management of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="4f290f5d-0af6-4495-b93a-b82ca8a810cd">
  <data key="d3">Having the right to assign the policy implies the need for documented proof of ownership, which justifies the policy owner’s entitlement to request a copy of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="3cb3e4ad-67f0-491d-beb0-fbdc5114922d">
  <data key="d3">Access to the policy allows the owner to verify terms before exercising the right to cancel, ensuring transparency and proper execution of the cancellation process.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7" target="07e46b3d-c885-48ba-b6cc-e766aa7d258b">
  <data key="d3">Having the right to receive a copy of the policy facilitates the owner’s ability to examine it, making the examination process actionable and informed.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="aebd5de6-c091-49b6-aced-8567f4b0435a" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has access right to policy copy</data>
</edge>
