</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">Access to premium payment history supports administrative transparency but does not affect how interest accumulates after death.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="03cfef7f-f2a0-44bd-864f-0344e97bc6d0">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence grants the policy owner authority to retrieve historical premium payment details. This information does not influence or relate to how beneficiaries are defined or selected.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 grants the policy owner the authority to retrieve historical premium data. This informational right operates independently of the death benefit distribution rules outlined in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="0c2f9120-31fb-43ab-81cd-fae794c65930">
  <data key="d3">This sentence states a procedural right available to the policy owner regarding documentation. The information about premium history does not affect how the death benefit is distributed in cases where survivors are absent, nor is it contingent on such distributions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
