<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner has the authority to request detailed information about past premium payments. This informational right operates independently of their capacity to transfer or assign the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT_RIGHTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to access premium payment history is unrelated to the company’s disclaimers concerning assignment validity. There is no logical dependence or influence between these two claims.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="89ec8af1-a187-47d1-be96-dd8563e25f71">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence grants the policy owner access to premium payment details, which is unrelated to the company’s disclaimers about tax consequences from assignments mentioned in the first sentence.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence grants the policy owner a record-access right unrelated to assignments, while the first emphasizes that such rights may be constrained if the policy has been assigned. This reflects a potential constraint rather than a direct interaction.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 grants access to premium payment details, which could inform decisions about policy cancellation mentioned in fact_sentence_1. However, the act of cancelling does not require accessing such information, so the connection remains indirect.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
