  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to designate beneficiaries directly supports the mechanism by which a change takes effect upon signature, making it actionable.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
