  <data key="d3">The policy owner’s right to designate beneficiaries exists independently of whether coverage is canceled; beneficiary designation is unaffected by the termination of coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610" target="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601">
  <data key="d3">The right to designate beneficiaries allows the policy owner to control who receives proceeds, potentially influencing whether they proceed with cancellation later.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
