<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">This statement refers to the company’s duty to respond promptly to requests for information, independent of how interest accumulates post-death.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="03cfef7f-f2a0-44bd-864f-0344e97bc6d0">
  <data key="d3">Providing information promptly supports transparency around beneficiary designations but does not require prior knowledge of who the beneficiary is to fulfill the commitment.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd">
  <data key="d3">This statement refers to the insurer's duty to respond promptly to requests for information. It has no connection to how the death benefit is distributed after the insured's passing.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="0c2f9120-31fb-43ab-81cd-fae794c65930">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that the insurance company will supply requested information promptly. This procedural commitment is independent of how the death benefit is distributed if no eligible beneficiaries survive.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">Upon submission of a written request to change a beneficiary, the company commits to timely response by delivering required information, ensuring transparency in the modification process.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS_RESPONSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
