<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="4ec4c4a4-c570-4478-be1c-c95a2d28b386">
  <data key="d3">After the policy owner submits a written request to change a beneficiary, the company agrees to deliver the required information within a reasonable period.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS_RESPONSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">The company agrees to deliver requested information promptly; however, this duty applies independently of whether the policy owner chooses to assign the policy. There is no requirement linking information provision to assignment activity.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence promises prompt delivery of information, whereas the first clarifies the company avoids liability for assignment validity. The two address separate operational responsibilities without causal or sequential dependence.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="89ec8af1-a187-47d1-be96-dd8563e25f71">
  <data key="d3">The second statement involves the company providing information in a timely manner, independent of whether it assumes responsibility for tax outcomes from assignments, which is addressed in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence concerns the company’s duty to deliver information promptly; however, it has no bearing on whether beneficiary or owner rights are restricted by assignment.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">The company agrees to deliver requested information within a reasonable timeframe. This commitment supports transparency but does not affect or rely on the policy owner’s ability to cancel coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd">
  <data key="d3">Even after cancellation and termination of coverage, the company remains obligated to fulfill information requests related to the policy in a timely manner.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_EFFECT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601">
  <data key="d3">Even if a policy is cancelled and no further benefits apply, the company remains obligated to deliver requested information within a reasonable period.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c">
  <data key="d3">Providing requested information within a reasonable time is unrelated to whether unearned premiums are refunded; it concerns transparency rather than financial adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
