  <data key="d3">The company commits to providing premium payment history within a reasonable timeframe when requested by the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">OBLIGATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The insurer's commitment to deliver requested beneficiary information depends on the policy owner exercising their right to make such requests.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">Upon the policy owner requesting riders or endorsements, the company agrees to supply the required details within a reasonable timeframe, fulfilling its duty in response to the owner’s right.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS_RESPONSE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">The statement about timely provision of information does not influence or relate to the policy owner’s choice of death benefit payment method.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="911c8355-e674-438d-8970-674b61225d1c">
  <data key="d3">The company agrees to timely provision of information, but any change to settlement options remains bound by available plan terms and restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb">
  <data key="d3">The company’s duty to timely provide information may support the process of submitting requests for settlement option changes, though it does not guarantee approval.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_DIRECT_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458" target="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes a general expectation for timely delivery of information, while fact_sentence_2 specifies that this obligation must align with applicable laws and regulations, ensuring legal compliance underpins the timeline.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
