  <data key="d3">The company complies with legal obligations by delivering requested information when needed. This includes supporting actions like updating beneficiary designations if such data is part of the inquiry.</data>
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="40cbb338-dde2-44ee-9830-c0c26916330c">
  <data key="d3">The company commits to supplying required information under law. This includes supporting documents related to assignments if initiated by the policy owner, facilitating compliance with ownership transfers.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="376c30b4-9340-49c7-86af-f148910aff82">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence confirms the company will comply with legal obligations to share information, whereas the first clarifies it does not guarantee the legality of assigned policies. Neither statement influences nor depends on the other; they pertain to separate administrative functions.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
