</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="f292fa61-3d93-4115-9af6-3725ae88913a">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence states the company’s commitment to comply with legal obligations regarding information provision. The first sentence focuses on how assignments constrain rights. Neither statement influences nor depends on the other.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="f36a1664-7f6f-4d19-a228-86f3f28f271d">
  <data key="d3">The company is obligated to release relevant policy information in compliance with law. This responsibility exists independently of whether the policy owner chooses to cancel the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="39685e64-b943-45f1-8db8-988a6da844bd">
  <data key="d3">Even after cancellation and coverage termination, the company remains obligated to fulfill requests for information under applicable laws.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_DEPENDENCY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="2ff34d5f-b479-4e87-94c4-d2a540372601">
  <data key="d3">Even if a policy is cancelled and no further benefits apply, the company remains obligated under law to furnish relevant documentation when requested.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="1241bca4-a181-4a4e-9fe3-1834756b497c">
  <data key="d3">The company commits to providing required information according to applicable laws, ensuring accountability. This duty may include disclosing details related to financial adjustments like unearned premium refunds.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFORMS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="5e7be213-5b9a-4b27-abe4-07034548f8e7">
  <data key="d3">The company provides policy copies when requested because the policy owner holds a legitimate right to access their own policy documentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESPONDS_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="1c612b00-c764-4d60-9e00-5642ec5e4c36">
  <data key="d3">The company commits to providing premium payment history upon request, fulfilling the policy owner’s established right to access such information.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="9a4ee5a5-54a6-4cfd-82d7-4f61d67a4610">
  <data key="d3">The company fulfills its regulatory duty by supplying requested beneficiary information, enabling the policy owner to act on their designated rights.</data>
  <data key="d4">RESPONDS_TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="70b7c267-94b3-4ca2-8b53-0f47120d88f4">
  <data key="d3">The company’s duty to supply rider-related information arises directly from the policy owner’s right to request such additions or modifications to the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="7845d152-d637-47c0-a88e-9b66f96e5458">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 imposes a legal framework on the provision of information, reinforcing that even though the response should occur "within a reasonable time," this standard is subject to statutory and regulatory constraints outlined in law.</data>
  <data key="d4">QUALIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="558f6754-63ec-4df4-bcd2-35ea7c37ab09">
  <data key="d3">The company’s duty to disclose information under law does not influence or determine how the death benefit is settled. This statement stands independently from decisions about payment methods.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="911c8355-e674-438d-8970-674b61225d1c">
  <data key="d3">The company's duty to disclose information does not affect the enforceability or availability of settlement options, which remain governed by specific plan terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="c81dbb82-548f-41f6-8919-0493d10f9c59" target="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb">
  <data key="d3">The company's duty to disclose information under law does not affect its authority to approve changes to settlement options. This statement sets a general compliance expectation unrelated to specific procedural approvals.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
