<edge source="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb" target="8173134a-e29e-4aa3-9deb-7944def59471">
  <data key="d3">Company approval is required before any change in settlement option takes effect, independent of when interest starts accruing after death.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb" target="03cfef7f-f2a0-44bd-864f-0344e97bc6d0">
  <data key="d3">Company approval is required for changes to settlement options, independent of how beneficiaries are defined in the policy documents.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb" target="e6149469-d151-4d22-aff3-fb7f2901e4bd">
  <data key="d3">This statement governs the formal process required to alter how the death benefit is distributed, independent of who ultimately receives it if no beneficiary survives.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb" target="0c2f9120-31fb-43ab-81cd-fae794c65930">
  <data key="d3">Changing the settlement method requires company approval, but this requirement does not affect who receives the death benefit if no beneficiary survives; the recipient is determined independently based on ownership and survivorship status.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb" target="1c097ac1-210c-471f-87e7-62f4f7ca9887">
  <data key="d3">While settling benefits involves an approved process managed by the insurer, changing beneficiaries does not require such approval but instead relies solely on submission of documentation from the policy owner.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELATIONSHIP</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="925dc2ea-b455-4473-b4ed-51ff493dd9eb" target="6903f2e1-fcf8-476e-af64-83ccd3093b64">
  <data key="d3">While a beneficiary change takes immediate effect upon signing, any modification to the settlement option must first be approved by the insurer, highlighting distinct procedural requirements between the two actions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
