  <data key="d3">Changes to the method of settling the death benefit require prior approval from the insurance company. This requirement operates separately from the policy owner’s power to cancel the policy entirely.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
