  <data key="d3">Settlement option choices are governed by available plan provisions, but those same provisions may influence how interest accumulates over time; however, the existence of interest accrual isn't contingent on choosing a specific settlement method.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
