<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="d3c440cf-41e3-4d0b-a3f0-ad9eb7117fb9">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy indicates when coverage begins, but it does not provide information about the specific policy form used. The form number uniquely identifies the policy type but does not specify its start date.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets the timeline for coverage but does not determine eligibility or mechanics of accelerated death benefit payouts.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="bb127988-dd0c-41ea-98d9-d68d41d35ba5">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets when coverage begins but does not determine eligibility for the accelerated benefit, which depends solely on medical diagnosis and life expectancy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="868545fb-b90c-4d86-aa47-b3fa5811f814">
  <data key="d3">The policy's effective date marks when coverage starts, but it does not determine whether the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider is available. The rider is offered as an optional add-on regardless of the policy start date.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="a82e95a0-cbf0-46a4-98e6-5b9250a0719c">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy determines when coverage begins but does not influence the requirement that a terminal illness diagnosis must include a life expectancy of 12 months or less.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="9c8ab001-f2e6-4dce-9c28-676af9b34008">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy establishes when coverage starts but does not influence the maximum allowable payout under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="24953031-60ae-4e53-8878-b13b08a99bb6">
  <data key="d3">The policy's effective date establishes when coverage begins, but this timing is independent of the medical certification process needed to determine life expectancy under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="221c721d-0cca-43e4-9fde-c98c985d9e46">
  <data key="d3">The policy's effective date sets the timeline for coverage but does not impact the requirement for medical documentation during a claims process.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="8c21a23d-34f1-400e-8692-3b5af49dbb3d">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy does not influence the maximum payment limit set by the company for the accelerated death benefit. The timing of policy activation is independent of the financial ceiling applied to benefit payouts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f">
  <data key="d3">The policy becoming effective on the scheduled date establishes the timeframe during which benefits may be available, though it does not determine when a request for accelerated payment can be made.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="c49d35db-1e22-49cf-aff0-80eed3363f59">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets the start time for coverage but does not influence the insurer’s authority to require a second medical opinion during a benefits claim process.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy establishes when benefits may become available but does not influence how interest impacts the reduced death benefit once paid out.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="c24c3db2-61fe-4fe8-b84c-a66c833de08e">
  <data key="d3">The policy becoming effective sets the stage for coverage but does not impact how the death benefit is adjusted upon acceleration. This adjustment occurs only after a claim is approved and processed.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="5959382c-3da3-4378-9d27-70eeead2dc9c">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy establishes when benefits may become available, but it does not determine how administrative charges impact the death benefit once payments are made.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="74ab917d-fe31-437b-954d-cb3c8c3a0cc2">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy determines when benefits become available, but it does not influence how outstanding liens are handled during the calculation of the adjusted death benefit after an accelerated payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="fa4bdb40-ec63-4909-8c9d-03d63650997f">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy marks when coverage begins, setting the stage for any financial obligations like loans that may later impact the death benefit. However, it does not influence how loans are subtracted upon acceleration.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="3d180056-1ee5-45c0-95de-957558f0d6c0">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets the timeline for coverage but does not influence whether benefits are denied due to self-inflicted injury. This exclusion applies regardless of when the policy became active.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="70e7fe46-b6c6-4910-8fcf-5836a44a1382">
  <data key="d3"></data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="147ebded-c5e9-4ee9-a600-a0613a4ac44b">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets the timeline for coverage but does not influence whether benefits are denied due to criminal activity leading to illness.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="cf34ad84-8215-4856-9bd3-153061d00093">
  <data key="d3">The effective date establishes when the policy starts, but it does not influence the timing or conditions under which a policyholder can revoke a request for accelerated benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="097f621e-9ee5-4ea1-bb84-d692f67b9f5b">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets the timeline for coverage but does not influence whether benefits are denied due to war-related causes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELEVANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="d40a8a1d-b256-47c5-bcc2-7c565e18e4a6">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy's benefits is determined by the schedule but has no relation to corporate leadership details such as the CEO's name.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d3">The effectiveness date of the policy is determined by the Schedule of Benefits but does not influence the requirement for written notice to revoke a benefit request.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy is unrelated to the location where it was signed. The timing of when coverage begins does not influence or result from the place of execution.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="f2b2eda1-ace9-416b-a284-68313b16efe9">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy sets when coverage begins but does not influence the definition or implications of fraudulent behavior.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="cfcb3d69-6bc4-465d-b7ca-f58645d5d6ee">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy does not influence or relate to the definition of fraudulent acts under insurance terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="4842aa86-8d77-49f2-8517-35dcccfe1dcd">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy establishes when coverage begins but does not influence the legality of making false claims.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee" target="7baa8b25-9b01-472b-86a7-c55acdb29369">
  <data key="d3">The effective date of the policy has no bearing on whether filing a claim with false information constitutes fraud. Fraud is determined independently based on honesty in documentation, regardless of when the policy takes effect.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
