<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="1f71e65a-9fb1-4dcf-bb24-91800bb3f3c7">
  <data key="d3">The policy takes effect only if the insured survives until the effective date; this condition does not rely on Sentinel Life Assurance being the issuing company.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee">
  <data key="d3">For the policy to take effect on the scheduled date, the insured must be alive at that moment; otherwise, the effective date has no operational consequence.</data>
  <data key="d4">DEPENDS_ON</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="05e6ea4e-3679-424b-a1ef-cd15cb0268c9">
  <data key="d3">Being alive on the effective date is a prerequisite for coverage eligibility, regardless of premium payments. However, it does not affect the necessity of paying the first premium to activate the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="d3c440cf-41e3-4d0b-a3f0-ad9eb7117fb9">
  <data key="d3">This statement establishes that the policy takes effect only if the individual is alive at the start date, but it does not relate to the policy's form number.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="868545fb-b90c-4d86-aa47-b3fa5811f814">
  <data key="d3">This statement establishes a prerequisite for policy validity but does not relate directly to the existence or functionality of the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes a prerequisite for policy validity tied to the insured's living status at inception. Fact_sentence_2 notes that policies might contain extra provisions mandated by individual states, independent of personal eligibility criteria.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="abd6a771-b2cc-4b47-8455-fa725fb92dac">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date ensures eligibility for any coverage, including optional riders like the one described. However, this clause does not influence whether riders are offered or how they function.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date ensures general policy validity but does not directly affect eligibility for accelerated death benefits, which depends on terminal diagnosis and life expectancy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="bb127988-dd0c-41ea-98d9-d68d41d35ba5">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured must be alive on the effective date ensures policy existence, but it does not influence whether an individual qualifies for the accelerated benefit upon terminal illness diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="a82e95a0-cbf0-46a4-98e6-5b9250a0719c">
  <data key="d3">The policy's activation depends on the insured being alive on the effective date, but this does not influence whether a terminal illness diagnosis meets the 12-month life expectancy threshold.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="8c21a23d-34f1-400e-8692-3b5af49dbb3d">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured must be alive on the effective date ensures policy validity but does not influence the maximum payment allowed under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="24953031-60ae-4e53-8878-b13b08a99bb6">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date ensures the policy exists at inception, enabling any future claims including those under the accelerated death benefit rider. However, it does not influence the need for physician-certified life expectancy.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f">
  <data key="d3">The policy's effectiveness depends on the insured being alive at the start date, but this does not affect the process of requesting an accelerated benefit later. The timing of policy activation is independent of submitting a written request for benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="221c721d-0cca-43e4-9fde-c98c985d9e46">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date ensures ongoing eligibility, though it does not influence the need for medical documentation when filing a claim. This precondition applies broadly to policy validity rather than specific claim procedures.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="9c8ab001-f2e6-4dce-9c28-676af9b34008">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date ensures general policy validity, while the 50% limit on accelerated benefits governs how much can be paid out upon qualifying diagnosis. These conditions operate in separate domains—one concerning initial policy activation, the other governing rider payouts.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="c49d35db-1e22-49cf-aff0-80eed3363f59">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date ensures eligibility for coverage, but it does not influence the insurer’s authority to request a second medical opinion during a claim process.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="c24c3db2-61fe-4fe8-b84c-a66c833de08e">
  <data key="d3">The policy's effectiveness depends on the insured being alive at the start date, but this does not directly affect how benefits impact the death benefit after payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="5959382c-3da3-4378-9d27-70eeead2dc9c">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured must be alive on the effective date ensures policy validity but does not influence how administrative charges impact the death benefit after acceleration.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d" target="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that the insured be alive on the effective date relates to policy initiation but does not influence how interest impacts the reduced death benefit after an accelerated payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
