  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 ensures the policy is active only if the insured survives to the effective date, setting a baseline for coverage. Fact_sentence_2 excludes payment when the terminal illness stems from a felony, adding a behavioral exception to benefit eligibility.</data>
