  <data key="d3">State-specific provisions are added post-issuance to meet jurisdictional laws, whereas the payment of the first premium is necessary for the policy to become active initially. The timing and purpose of each statement differ significantly.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
