  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 notes that state laws may impose additional requirements on the rider, but it does not relate directly to how a request can be revoked. Fact_sentence_2 specifies the formal method for withdrawing a request, independent of jurisdictional variations.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46" target="f2b2eda1-ace9-416b-a284-68313b16efe9">
  <data key="d3">State-specific legal notices may supplement general policy terms, but they do not alter the core rule about fraud being prohibited regardless of jurisdictional variations.</data>
  <data key="d4">IRRELEVANT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46" target="7baa8b25-9b01-472b-86a7-c55acdb29369">
  <data key="d3">State-specific notices ensure compliance with regional laws, but do not directly influence the definition or penalties related to submitting false information on applications or claims.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_RELEVANCE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46" target="4842aa86-8d77-49f2-8517-35dcccfe1dcd">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 refers to potential jurisdictional variations in policy disclosures, whereas fact_sentence_2 defines illegal behavior related to falsifying information during claims processing. The two touch on separate regulatory and behavioral domains without overlap.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46" target="cfcb3d69-6bc4-465d-b7ca-f58645d5d6ee">
  <data key="d3">State-specific legal notices ensure compliance with regional regulations, while fraudulent acts undermine the integrity of claim submissions. Both serve protective roles but operate independently within different domains of policy governance.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.2</data>
</edge>
