<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="1f71e65a-9fb1-4dcf-bb24-91800bb3f3c7">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a prerequisite step for receiving an accelerated benefit; however, it is independent of who issued the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">UNRELATED</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is required to access accelerated benefits, regardless of when the policy became effective.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="05e6ea4e-3679-424b-a1ef-cd15cb0268c9">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request for an accelerated benefit is part of the claims process under an existing active policy. It assumes the policy is already effective due to payment of premiums, though the request itself doesn't affect initial policy activation.</data>
  <data key="d4">POSTERIOR TO</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.35</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request for an accelerated benefit is required once eligible, regardless of whether the policy was active due to the insured surviving the effective date. This step occurs post-inception and is unrelated to initial policy eligibility conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="d3c440cf-41e3-4d0b-a3f0-ad9eb7117fb9">
  <data key="d3"></data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a necessary action to claim benefits, regardless of whether additional state-specific notices are present.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="abd6a771-b2cc-4b47-8455-fa725fb92dac">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a procedural step required to access an accelerated benefit, which only exists because the policy offers optional riders enabling such provisions.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="868545fb-b90c-4d86-aa47-b3fa5811f814">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a required action to access the benefits offered by the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider, which was introduced earlier as an optional policy add-on.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request enables the policyholder to access the early payment provision under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="bb127988-dd0c-41ea-98d9-d68d41d35ba5">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is required to access the accelerated benefit; however, such a request cannot proceed unless the individual meets the diagnostic criteria established in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="a82e95a0-cbf0-46a4-98e6-5b9250a0719c">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is contingent upon having already met the diagnostic criteria, including a prognosis of 12 months or less survival, which triggers eligibility for the accelerated benefit process.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="24953031-60ae-4e53-8878-b13b08a99bb6">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is necessary to activate the claims process; however, such a request cannot be processed without prior confirmation from a licensed physician regarding the policyholder’s terminal prognosis.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRED_FOR</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="9c8ab001-f2e6-4dce-9c28-676af9b34008">
  <data key="d3">A written request must be made first to qualify for any benefit, ensuring that the 50% cap applies only when the claim initiation step occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENABLES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="8c21a23d-34f1-400e-8692-3b5af49dbb3d">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is required to begin the evaluation for receiving benefits. Without this step, even if the maximum allowed amount were known, no payment could proceed.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES LIMITATION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="221c721d-0cca-43e4-9fde-c98c985d9e46">
  <data key="d3">A written request is required to initiate the accelerated benefit claim, but it cannot proceed without accompanying medical evidence verifying eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">REQUIRES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="c24c3db2-61fe-4fe8-b84c-a66c833de08e">
  <data key="d3">A written request must be submitted by the policyholder to initiate the accelerated benefit payment process.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="c49d35db-1e22-49cf-aff0-80eed3363f59">
  <data key="d3">After submitting a written request, the insurer may require a second medical opinion to confirm eligibility for the accelerated benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="5959382c-3da3-4378-9d27-70eeead2dc9c">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request initiates the process that results in the application of administrative charges, which are deducted from the death benefit when the accelerated benefit is paid out.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa">
  <data key="d3">A written request from the policyholder initiates the acceleration process, enabling the insurer to disburse funds subject to conditions including future reductions due to accumulated interest.</data>
  <data key="d4">TRIGGERS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="fa4bdb40-ec63-4909-8c9d-03d63650997f">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request initiates the claim process, leading to evaluation where existing loans are considered in adjusting the remaining death benefit. This ensures accurate accounting once funds are disbursed.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="74ab917d-fe31-437b-954d-cb3c8c3a0cc2">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request initiates the claims process, enabling the insurer to assess eligibility and calculate the adjusted death benefit, including deductions for outstanding liens.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="70e7fe46-b6c6-4910-8fcf-5836a44a1382">
  <data key="d3"></data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="147ebded-c5e9-4ee9-a600-a0613a4ac44b">
  <data key="d3">A written request is required to access accelerated benefits, but such payments are voided if the terminal illness stems from criminal activity, including felonies.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_EXCLUSION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="097f621e-9ee5-4ea1-bb84-d692f67b9f5b">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is required to initiate an accelerated benefit claim, but even with such a submission, payment is denied if the illness stems from war-related causes.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_EXCLUSION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="cf34ad84-8215-4856-9bd3-153061d00093">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request initiates the process for receiving accelerated benefits, enabling the policyholder to later withdraw their application before funds are paid out.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="3d180056-1ee5-45c0-95de-957558f0d6c0">
  <data key="d3">A written request is required to initiate the accelerated benefit process; however, payment will not be made if the illness was intentionally self-inflicted, rendering the request ineffective under such circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONDITIONAL_EXCLUSION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="d40a8a1d-b256-47c5-bcc2-7c565e18e4a6">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is required to access the accelerated benefit, but this step has no connection to the identity of the company's CEO.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d3">A written request is required to begin receiving the accelerated benefit, establishing the first formal step in the claims process. This requirement enables the subsequent ability to revoke the request via written notice before any funds are disbursed.</data>
  <data key="d4">PRECEDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a condition for receiving accelerated benefits, but it has no bearing on where the policy was originally executed.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="4842aa86-8d77-49f2-8517-35dcccfe1dcd">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a prerequisite for receiving benefits, and knowingly falsifying information during this step constitutes insurance fraud, reinforcing the need for truthful submissions.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTEXTUAL WARNING</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="7baa8b25-9b01-472b-86a7-c55acdb29369">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a required step to access benefits, but it does not inherently involve falsification of information. The act of filing a request remains neutral regarding truthfulness unless accompanied by deceptive content.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="cfcb3d69-6bc4-465d-b7ca-f58645d5d6ee">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is a prerequisite step to access benefits, while committing fraud undermines the legitimacy of such a request. Fraudulent acts could invalidate any submitted request regardless of its formal compliance.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.45</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="f2b2eda1-ace9-416b-a284-68313b16efe9">
  <data key="d3">Submitting a written request is part of the formal procedure to access benefits, but concealing facts undermines the integrity of that process and may lead to legal penalties.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONTRADICTS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="a95c37fd-7aad-43df-a80d-09cc336f0ae6">
  <data key="d3">The Death Benefit's final amount may be reduced by accelerated payments, making it contingent upon procedures like submitting a written request under specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">REDUCED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="25f4cee7-d9c0-44f5-9b59-9dd48a31e12d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 describes a process for receiving a benefit, which directly depends on the general condition stated in fact_sentence_1—that all benefits are bound by policy terms and exclusions.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="cd70f299-b66e-49aa-b3c6-69fcc2129242">
  <data key="d3">The need for written approval outlined in fact_sentence_1 supports the specific condition in fact_sentence_2 requiring a written request for accelerated benefits, demonstrating procedural alignment across policy administration.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="2da9f77a-5318-41fa-9bdb-52b9728b043d">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 describes a specific procedure requiring a written request to access an accelerated benefit, aligning with the broader rule in fact_sentence_1 that all policy-related changes need written approval from an authorized officer, thus reinforcing compliance protocols.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="cca9f6cf-6067-42df-94ad-2563bd3117d4">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1's restriction on unauthorized changes supports the necessity of a formal, documented process like the one required in fact_sentence_2 for accessing benefits under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">CORROBORATES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f" target="9f637f68-638b-4eec-9c72-453a879fc0d8">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 ensures only authorized personnel can modify policies; this supports the necessity of a formal written request for benefits like those described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES_PROCEDURE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
