  <data key="d3">A valid claim requires medical proof approved by the insurer, ensuring legitimacy; knowingly falsifying such documents constitutes insurance fraud, reinforcing compliance.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
