<edge source="c49d35db-1e22-49cf-aff0-80eed3363f59" target="1f71e65a-9fb1-4dcf-bb24-91800bb3f3c7">
  <data key="d3">The insurer’s reserved right to obtain a second medical opinion reflects an operational control mechanism that operates under the governance of the issuing company, Sentinel Life Assurance Company, ensuring compliance with policy conditions.</data>
