  <data key="d3">The insurer’s right to obtain a second medical opinion applies regardless of when the policy became effective, focusing on clinical validation rather than timing of coverage initiation.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
