  <data key="d3">The existence of a maximum payment limit influences how seriously the Company evaluates claims; requiring a second opinion safeguards against overpayment and ensures compliance with financial caps.</data>
  <data key="d4">INFLUENCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
