  <data key="d3">The insurer may require a second medical opinion to confirm eligibility, which helps ensure that cases involving self-inflicted injuries are properly identified and excluded per policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">ENFORCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
