  <data key="d3">The insurer may require a second medical opinion to validate the terminal illness diagnosis, ensuring that claims meet criteria such as excluding those resulting from felonies.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
