  <data key="d3">The insurer may require a second medical opinion to verify terminal diagnosis, but this does not affect the requirement that any revocation of a benefit request must be submitted in writing.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_EFFECT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
