  <data key="d3">The insurer may require a second medical opinion to validate the terminal illness diagnosis, ensuring credibility before processing any benefits. This step does not override exclusions like those due to war-related causes, which remain separate grounds for denial regardless of diagnostic confirmation.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXEMPT_BY</data>
