  <data key="d3">The first sentence describes how administrative charges affect the death benefit after acceleration. This financial detail has no bearing on where the policy was formally executed.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="5959382c-3da3-4378-9d27-70eeead2dc9c" target="f2b2eda1-ace9-416b-a284-68313b16efe9">
  <data key="d3">Administrative charges reduce the death benefit when an accelerated benefit is paid, ensuring that costs are accounted for post-disbursement. This procedural detail does not directly influence whether fraud occurs but may affect overall payout amounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">NO_DIRECT_RELATIONSHIP</data>
