  <data key="d3">Since interest on the accelerated benefit reduces the death benefit, this detail supports why the rider is considered a significant financial component that impacts overall policy settlement.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXPLAINS</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3">Accumulated interest on the accelerated benefit necessitates that the total death benefit be reduced when calculating the final payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSED_BY</data>
