</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="bb127988-dd0c-41ea-98d9-d68d41d35ba5">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the accelerated benefit directly diminishes the total death benefit available at settlement, but only applies after the insured has qualified under the terms tied to a terminal illness diagnosis.</data>
  <data key="d4">REDUCES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="a82e95a0-cbf0-46a4-98e6-5b9250a0719c">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the accelerated benefit reduces the death benefit only after the policyholder meets the qualifying condition of having a terminal illness with a life expectancy of 12 months or less.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="24953031-60ae-4e53-8878-b13b08a99bb6">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the accelerated benefit reduces the overall death benefit payable upon the insured’s passing. This deduction occurs only after the initial qualification step, including physician-certified life expectancy confirmation.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="9c8ab001-f2e6-4dce-9c28-676af9b34008">
  <data key="d3">Since interest on the accelerated benefit reduces the death benefit, it operates as a consequence of receiving funds under the 50%-of-face-value limit established earlier.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="8c21a23d-34f1-400e-8692-3b5af49dbb3d">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest reduces the remaining death benefit, meaning the actual impact of the maximum payment limit depends on how much interest accumulates during the period before payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIED_BY</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the paid-out benefit necessitates a subsequent reduction in the death benefit, making it essential that the initial step—a formal written request—has been fulfilled to trigger such adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d4">CONSEQUENCE_OF</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="221c721d-0cca-43e4-9fde-c98c985d9e46">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the accelerated benefit directly impacts the final death benefit, so accurate calculation depends on timely processing after approval based on submitted medical evidence.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="c49d35db-1e22-49cf-aff0-80eed3363f59">
  <data key="d3">Interest accrued on the accelerated benefit reduces the overall death benefit; however, this financial adjustment has no bearing on whether a second medical opinion is requested.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="c24c3db2-61fe-4fe8-b84c-a66c833de08e">
  <data key="d3">Accrued interest on the accelerated benefit increases the total amount subtracted from the death benefit, reinforcing the impact of early payouts on final benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="5959382c-3da3-4378-9d27-70eeead2dc9c">
  <data key="d3">Interest accrued on the accelerated benefit decreases the overall death benefit, just like administrative charges do; both serve as financial adjustments that diminish the remaining payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="fa4bdb40-ec63-4909-8c9d-03d63650997f">
  <data key="d3">Interest on the accelerated benefit reduces the remaining death benefit, and this reduction occurs alongside other financial obligations like outstanding loans, which are also subtracted during adjustment calculations.</data>
  <data key="d4">COMPLEMENTARY_REDUCTION</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa" target="74ab917d-fe31-437b-954d-cb3c8c3a0cc2">
  <data key="d3">Interest charged on the accelerated benefit directly impacts the net death benefit available to beneficiaries; similarly, any existing liens on the policy further diminish the adjusted death benefit after acceleration.</data>
  <data key="d4">MODIFIES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
