  <data key="d3">The first sentence explains that accrued interest diminishes the final death benefit when benefits are advanced. The second sentence states that payments are denied if the illness was intentionally self-inflicted, forming a separate eligibility restriction unrelated to interest calculations.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXCLUDES</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.15</data>
</edge>
