  <data key="d3">The statement about interest reducing the death benefit describes a financial consequence of receiving funds early. This detail stands independently from the policyholder's ability to cancel a request before payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
