  <data key="d3">The first sentence explains how accrued interest affects the remaining death benefit after acceleration. The second sentence warns that falsifying information during claims or applications is considered fraudulent behavior.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
