  <data key="d3">Loan balances are subtracted from the adjusted death benefit when accelerating payments, regardless of when the policy became effective; thus, the timing of policy inception has no bearing on this deduction process.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
