<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="1f71e65a-9fb1-4dcf-bb24-91800bb3f3c7">
  <data key="d3">The policy was executed at the Home Office in Hartford, Connecticut, which belongs to Sentinel Life Assurance Company—the entity responsible for issuing the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">EXECUTION SITE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.3</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="20fbfea1-87f5-44e4-993f-62b3ff2e28ee">
  <data key="d3">The location where the policy was executed does not determine its effective date. Signing at a specific office has no bearing on when the policy officially starts.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="05e6ea4e-3679-424b-a1ef-cd15cb0268c9">
  <data key="d3">Executing the policy at the Home Office in Hartford does not affect whether the first premium has been paid; it relates solely to administrative location, not policy validity conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">INDEPENDENT</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="57f1482e-c194-4d7c-89bc-95a96701db5d">
  <data key="d3">The policy being executed in Hartford, Connecticut, specifies administrative logistics but has no bearing on whether the insured survives until the effective date.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="d3c440cf-41e3-4d0b-a3f0-ad9eb7117fb9">
  <data key="d3">The policy was executed at a physical office location; this does not affect the identification of the policy via its form number.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="4be625d8-db33-4685-8ec1-310ef9190d46">
  <data key="d3">The policy's execution site in Hartford, Connecticut, is independent of any state-specific legal notices that may accompany the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="abd6a771-b2cc-4b47-8455-fa725fb92dac">
  <data key="d3">The execution of the policy at a specific office has no bearing on whether optional riders are part of the policy terms.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="868545fb-b90c-4d86-aa47-b3fa5811f814">
  <data key="d3">The policy being executed in Hartford, Connecticut, has no bearing on whether the Accelerated Death Benefit Rider is offered. Location of execution does not affect product features like riders.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="e7abe25a-548e-4854-99a9-005d2c7abd86">
  <data key="d3"></data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="bb127988-dd0c-41ea-98d9-d68d41d35ba5">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies the administrative location of policy execution. This factual detail is unrelated to the medical qualifications required for accessing accelerated benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="a82e95a0-cbf0-46a4-98e6-5b9250a0719c">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 specifies the physical location of policy execution. This detail does not influence or relate to the medical prognosis needed for benefit access.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="24953031-60ae-4e53-8878-b13b08a99bb6">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence notes that the policy was signed at a specific office location. However, this does not influence or relate to the medical certification required for life expectancy assessment under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="9c8ab001-f2e6-4dce-9c28-676af9b34008">
  <data key="d3">The policy being executed in Hartford, Connecticut, provides administrative context but does not affect the 50% limitation on accelerated death benefits specified in the other statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="8c21a23d-34f1-400e-8692-3b5af49dbb3d">
  <data key="d3">The policy's execution at the Home Office in Hartford does not influence the cap on accelerated death benefit payouts.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="07aa45e3-df8b-4fdc-a2d7-4ebdc9b4974f">
  <data key="d3">The location of policy execution at Sentinel Life's Home Office in Hartford, CT, does not affect the requirement to submit a written request for benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="221c721d-0cca-43e4-9fde-c98c985d9e46">
  <data key="d3">The place where the policy was executed—Hartford, Connecticut—is independent of the necessity for medical proof when requesting accelerated benefits. Execution location does not influence document submission rules.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="c49d35db-1e22-49cf-aff0-80eed3363f59">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence indicates that the policy was executed in Hartford, Connecticut, which has no bearing on the insurer’s ability to request a second medical opinion under the rider terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="c24c3db2-61fe-4fe8-b84c-a66c833de08e">
  <data key="d3">The policy's execution location in Hartford, Connecticut, is unrelated to how the death benefit changes upon acceleration of benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="5959382c-3da3-4378-9d27-70eeead2dc9c">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence states that the policy was executed in Hartford, Connecticut. This geographic detail does not influence or relate to the application of administrative charges on the accelerated benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="8690a7f5-82be-413d-a92b-8be70122f5aa">
  <data key="d3">The location where the policy was executed has no bearing on how interest impacts the reduced death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="fa4bdb40-ec63-4909-8c9d-03d63650997f">
  <data key="d3">The policy being executed in Hartford, Connecticut, does not influence how loans impact the post-acceleration death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="74ab917d-fe31-437b-954d-cb3c8c3a0cc2">
  <data key="d3">The policy's execution location in Hartford, Connecticut, has no bearing on lien deductions from the accelerated death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="3d180056-1ee5-45c0-95de-957558f0d6c0">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies the physical location where the policy was executed. This administrative detail does not influence whether a benefit is payable due to self-harm or other causes.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="147ebded-c5e9-4ee9-a600-a0613a4ac44b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies the location where the policy was signed but provides no contextual link to the eligibility rules governing accelerated benefits discussed in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="097f621e-9ee5-4ea1-bb84-d692f67b9f5b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 provides logistical information regarding the policy's execution site. It has no bearing on whether payments are denied due to war-related causes.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="cf34ad84-8215-4856-9bd3-153061d00093">
  <data key="d3">The second sentence specifies that the policy was executed in Hartford, Connecticut, but offers no context regarding claims procedures or the ability to revoke benefit requests. The first sentence outlines a contractual right tied to claim management, independent of the policy’s place of issuance.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="42959f78-4be8-4477-9f82-ca39bf16f6b5">
  <data key="d3">The execution of the policy at Sentinel Life's Home Office in Hartford, Connecticut, does not influence or relate to the need for written notice when revoking a benefit request. The location of execution is irrelevant to the revocation process described.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="d40a8a1d-b256-47c5-bcc2-7c565e18e4a6">
  <data key="d3">The policy is executed at the Home Office in Hartford, Connecticut, though this location is independent of who leads the company, such as CEO Eleanor B. Raynor.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="70e7fe46-b6c6-4910-8fcf-5836a44a1382">
  <data key="d3">The policy being executed at the company’s Home Office does not depend on who holds the CEO position; it reflects administrative procedure rather than organizational hierarchy.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="f2b2eda1-ace9-416b-a284-68313b16efe9">
  <data key="d3">The location of policy execution has no bearing on whether concealing material facts qualifies as fraud under insurance law.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="7baa8b25-9b01-472b-86a7-c55acdb29369">
  <data key="d3">The location of policy execution does not influence the legality of submitting false information on claims. This statement stands independently from procedural details about where documents are processed.</data>
  <data key="d4">NONE</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="4842aa86-8d77-49f2-8517-35dcccfe1dcd">
  <data key="d3">The execution location of the policy at Sentinel Life's Home Office does not relate to the legal definition of fraudulent insurance acts involving false statements.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4dda5c60-5f9a-445b-896e-afcf680b072f" target="cfcb3d69-6bc4-465d-b7ca-f58645d5d6ee">
  <data key="d3">The location of policy execution has no bearing on the legal definition of fraudulent insurance acts involving knowledge of falsity or concealment.</data>
  <data key="d4"></data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.0</data>
</edge>
